1
00:05:09,849 --> 00:05:17,148
[Devotional song playing]

2
00:05:24,787 --> 00:05:31,960
[Devotional song playing]

3
00:06:55,712 --> 00:07:00,045
Today's generation wants everything instantly.

4
00:07:00,670 --> 00:07:03,045
They have absolutely no patience.

5
00:07:03,629 --> 00:07:04,837
What’s your name, boy?

6
00:07:05,092 --> 00:07:07,805
Why do we need introductions to the man
who ran off with my daughter, Peddi Reddy?

7
00:07:08,155 --> 00:07:09,113
Just kill that scoundrel!

8
00:07:10,271 --> 00:07:13,355
If it comes to that, I’ll have to kill your daughter too.

9
00:07:13,605 --> 00:07:17,263
Your daughter also chose to run away...
she didn’t go out to watch a movie.

10
00:07:18,256 --> 00:07:21,372
First teach the children what
mistake they’ve actually made.

11
00:07:25,730 --> 00:07:26,771
Lavanya!

12
00:07:27,063 --> 00:07:28,021
Is it your mother's name?

13
00:07:29,352 --> 00:07:30,102
Sister's?

14
00:07:30,686 --> 00:07:31,436
Younger sister's?

15
00:07:32,396 --> 00:07:36,229
God forbid, is "Lavanya" your daughter's name?

16
00:07:36,230 --> 00:07:37,146
Did he get a tattoo? He must have.

17
00:07:37,382 --> 00:07:40,188
You guys do stunts like this just to impress girls.

18
00:07:42,396 --> 00:07:44,163
If you want a tattoo,

19
00:07:44,188 --> 00:07:49,146
ink the names of the ones who'll think about you from
the day you were born until their very last breath...

20
00:07:50,425 --> 00:07:53,759
your mother and father.

21
00:07:54,215 --> 00:07:57,590
Did we raise our daughters just
for you to run off with them?

22
00:07:58,107 --> 00:08:00,741
And if you get married and return,
are we supposed to wash your feet?

23
00:08:02,846 --> 00:08:04,596
you want a tattoo, don't you?

24
00:08:04,945 --> 00:08:06,439
Come, I'll give you one!

25
00:08:11,550 --> 00:08:13,342
Please, sir... spare me.
I beg you.

26
00:08:13,467 --> 00:08:14,342
Please let me go.

27
00:08:15,592 --> 00:08:16,509
Please sir.

28
00:08:19,009 --> 00:08:20,884
Before falling in love with a girl,

29
00:08:20,967 --> 00:08:24,717
shouldn’t you first know whose daughter she is
and who stands behind her family?

30
00:08:25,092 --> 00:08:25,675
Sir.. sir.. sir...

31
00:08:30,717 --> 00:08:34,884
Before this wound heals,
you must be out of her life.

32
00:08:36,467 --> 00:08:36,967
Guys, move!

33
00:08:47,675 --> 00:08:52,634
Ask your daughter where she got
her tattoo and have it removed.

34
00:08:56,134 --> 00:08:58,300
How can such sinful acts
happen in a place this holy?

35
00:08:59,925 --> 00:09:01,925
Is this your first time in Tirupati?

36
00:09:02,259 --> 00:09:02,717
Yes.

37
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:05,925
Many people come here to seek
merit after committing sins.

38
00:09:06,092 --> 00:09:09,634
But this place has more sinners than saints.

39
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:12,217
By the way, who is that man?

40
00:09:12,550 --> 00:09:14,009
Who else but Peddi Reddy!

41
00:09:14,342 --> 00:09:20,259
In Tirupati, people fear Peddi Reddy
as much as they fear the God on the hill.

42
00:09:41,759 --> 00:09:46,425
[Devotional song playing]

43
00:09:48,467 --> 00:09:54,884
[Devotional song playing]

44
00:10:06,967 --> 00:10:11,842
Balu Orchestra... Shamiana Services.

45
00:10:20,675 --> 00:10:21,842
What is it, boy? A wedding?

46
00:10:22,134 --> 00:10:23,342
I have no plans for that anytime soon, sir.

47
00:10:24,134 --> 00:10:25,300
Did someone pass away?

48
00:10:26,477 --> 00:10:27,310
No one passed away...

49
00:10:27,384 --> 00:10:28,092
I just came here myself.

50
00:10:28,342 --> 00:10:29,216
No, that's not what I meant.

51
00:10:29,217 --> 00:10:30,341
What is the occasion?

52
00:10:30,342 --> 00:10:33,674
Is it a wedding, a funeral, a birthday,
a felicitation, a retirement...

53
00:10:33,675 --> 00:10:34,675
what is the event?

54
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:36,050
It’s not that, sir.

55
00:10:36,175 --> 00:10:38,634
My uncle, Munirathnam, sent me to meet Mr. Balu.

56
00:10:39,634 --> 00:10:41,634
Oh, is that so?
Sorry, boy... come on in.

57
00:10:42,342 --> 00:10:45,759
We haven't had customers in a while,
so we mistake everyone who comes in for one.

58
00:10:45,884 --> 00:10:47,549
That's why I spoke that way.
Please don't mind.

59
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:48,467
Come on in.

60
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:03,759
Wow, you're so handsome!

61
00:11:09,904 --> 00:11:12,779
[Singing a song]

62
00:11:19,175 --> 00:11:19,886
Dear!

63
00:11:20,425 --> 00:11:21,884
This young man has come to meet you.

64
00:11:22,217 --> 00:11:24,592
Hi... I'm Sreenu.
Ratnam Uncle sent me.

65
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:26,425
Your uncle is a dear friend of mine.

66
00:11:26,682 --> 00:11:28,223
He even called to let me know you were coming.

67
00:11:30,050 --> 00:11:32,175
By the way, I heard there was
some trouble at the college.

68
00:11:32,342 --> 00:11:33,300
Yes, sir. It was a student issue.

69
00:11:33,467 --> 00:11:36,175
It started as a minor scuffle
but escalated into a major case.

70
00:11:38,509 --> 00:11:40,925
Well, fights are common in our age group.

71
00:11:42,467 --> 00:11:43,884
By the way, you had no trouble
finding my place, right?

72
00:11:43,925 --> 00:11:44,884
I was actually shocked!

73
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:47,425
When I asked for your address,
people were competing to bring me here...

74
00:11:47,925 --> 00:11:49,550
they practically started fighting over it.

75
00:11:49,925 --> 00:11:52,134
That's the respect they have for the artist in me.

76
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:56,467
Regardless, I’m very happy to stay in the
home of such a great person like you for four days.

77
00:11:56,842 --> 00:12:00,003
Why just four days?
Stay as long as you like.

78
00:12:00,281 --> 00:12:02,656
Hey, why are you standing there like a statue?

79
00:12:03,086 --> 00:12:04,800
Go... show Sreenu his room.

80
00:12:04,842 --> 00:12:06,050
Sure.
Come along, boy.

81
00:12:06,634 --> 00:12:08,425
Bloody useless! You total dimwit.

82
00:12:11,175 --> 00:12:13,509
[Singing a song]

83
00:12:14,134 --> 00:12:15,467
Since when has he been missing?

84
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:16,467
It’s been two days, sir.

85
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:17,592
Namaste.

86
00:12:18,342 --> 00:12:19,217
You stay here.

87
00:12:24,050 --> 00:12:24,717
Shall I sit?

88
00:12:24,900 --> 00:12:25,834
Of course, sit down.

89
00:12:31,134 --> 00:12:34,800
If we make even a small mistake,
you pile endless cases on us, don’t you?

90
00:12:35,509 --> 00:12:39,425
But Peddi Reddy assaulted our boy in the
middle of the road, right in front of everyone,

91
00:12:39,967 --> 00:12:41,967
without even caring that he was just a young boy.

92
00:12:42,675 --> 00:12:43,675
What are you going to do about him?

93
00:12:43,884 --> 00:12:47,675
If someone eloped with a girl from your family,
would you just stay quiet?

94
00:12:47,967 --> 00:12:49,967
Didn't the girl know she was eloping?

95
00:12:50,384 --> 00:12:51,967
Did she just follow him because
he showed her a chocolate?

96
00:12:52,310 --> 00:12:54,602
You're talking complete nonsense, DSP!

97
00:12:55,967 --> 00:12:56,925
Look, Narayanappa,

98
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:59,259
whether you want to talk and settle for a marriage...

99
00:12:59,717 --> 00:13:02,748
or hold a meeting to get money
for medical expenses, that’s up to you.

100
00:13:03,050 --> 00:13:04,881
Don't waste my time unnecessarily.

101
00:13:05,977 --> 00:13:07,018
You’ve shown your true colors.

102
00:13:08,363 --> 00:13:11,946
You look down on us just because
we're migrants from Tamil Nadu, don't you?

103
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:14,187
You think we’re powerless.

104
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:18,544
There are nearly 50,000 of us here in Tirupati.

105
00:13:19,643 --> 00:13:20,393
We’ll see how this ends.

106
00:13:22,134 --> 00:13:23,050
Alright then...

107
00:13:25,592 --> 00:13:26,842
Brother, how can he speak like that?

108
00:13:28,678 --> 00:13:29,720
We're not locals, are we?

109
00:13:30,134 --> 00:13:33,467
Peddi Reddy is crushing us in everything
from business to personal matters.

110
00:13:33,819 --> 00:13:34,735
Don't we can't touch him, brother.

111
00:13:35,134 --> 00:13:36,675
You know the story of Gajendra Moksham, right?

112
00:13:37,384 --> 00:13:40,800
It’s like when an elephant enters
a lake for water and a crocodile grabs it.

113
00:13:42,134 --> 00:13:43,925
What is a crocodile’s strength
compared to an elephant's? Nothing.

114
00:13:44,384 --> 00:13:48,300
But the lake is the crocodile’s home
turf.. just like Tirupati is to Peddi Reddy.

115
00:13:48,550 --> 00:13:51,342
Like that elephant, let’s trust in God.

116
00:13:52,384 --> 00:13:55,134
He will manifest in some form to help us.

117
00:13:55,675 --> 00:13:59,001
Then we’ll deal with that Peddi Reddy.

118
00:14:00,259 --> 00:14:02,175
Alright then, I’ll get going.
- Okay Brother.

119
00:14:03,467 --> 00:14:03,925
Okay Brother.

120
00:14:09,592 --> 00:14:10,675
Why did you remove your thali (sacred thread)?

121
00:14:10,967 --> 00:14:12,967
Because it was getting wet in the temple pond...

122
00:14:13,092 --> 00:14:14,384
So what if it gets wet?

123
00:14:14,842 --> 00:14:16,592
Don't you care about your husband’s well-being?

124
00:14:16,967 --> 00:14:18,009
You...

125
00:14:18,634 --> 00:14:21,008
I'll dunk you in the water three times
along with that thali, you...!

126
00:14:21,009 --> 00:14:23,800
Oh, not again... I can't do this anymore!

127
00:14:26,092 --> 00:14:27,009
Oh God!

128
00:14:28,175 --> 00:14:29,509
Manga! Sister Manga!

129
00:14:33,675 --> 00:14:35,384
Sister Manga!

130
00:14:54,842 --> 00:14:57,424
"As if the light of a hundred thousand
full moons gathered together,"

131
00:14:57,425 --> 00:15:00,008
"and the radiance of the stars stood before me..."

132
00:15:00,009 --> 00:15:04,925
Sister Manga, you’re being called over there!

133
00:15:05,467 --> 00:15:06,259
I'm coming.

134
00:15:06,634 --> 00:15:10,550
"As if the divine forms of all the angels
appeared together in a single vision..."

135
00:15:14,967 --> 00:15:20,425
"As if an explosion as vast as the sky
suddenly crashed down upon me..."

136
00:15:25,009 --> 00:15:34,842
"My heart is exploding...
It’s bursting apart..."

137
00:15:35,092 --> 00:15:45,082
"My heart is exploding...
It’s bursting apart..."

138
00:15:45,342 --> 00:15:49,675
"I’m unable to withstand this feeling flowing
through every atom of me..."

139
00:15:50,342 --> 00:15:55,092
"I’m unable to hold onto a dream this
beautiful even for a moment."

140
00:15:55,425 --> 00:16:00,175
"My heart is exploding..."

141
00:16:00,467 --> 00:16:05,050
"It’s bursting apart..."

142
00:16:05,584 --> 00:16:10,418
"My heart is exploding...
It’s bursting apart..."

143
00:16:58,509 --> 00:17:03,841
"Gazing at your golden lips, I forgot to blink."

144
00:17:03,842 --> 00:17:08,841
"I forgot to breathe reading your eyes."

145
00:17:08,842 --> 00:17:13,841
"I forgot to look around me while
playing with your flowing hair."

146
00:17:13,842 --> 00:17:19,049
"I even forgot my own existence
while drowning in your beauty."

147
00:17:19,050 --> 00:17:21,466
"That rare forehead... That heavy bosom..."

148
00:17:21,467 --> 00:17:23,800
"That slender waist
all are yours alone."

149
00:17:23,925 --> 00:17:29,133
"That gentle step... That lively way of speaking...
That graceful little sway... all belong to you..."

150
00:17:29,134 --> 00:17:33,883
"As all your youthful charms strike
down upon me like lightning..."

151
00:17:33,884 --> 00:17:43,800
"My heart is exploding...
It’s bursting apart..."

152
00:17:44,050 --> 00:17:49,299
"My heart is exploding...
It’s bursting apart..."

153
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:54,175
"My heart is exploding... It’s bursting apart..."

154
00:18:11,634 --> 00:18:15,842
God, bless me to remain safe tomorrow
just as I was yesterday and as I am today.

155
00:18:16,092 --> 00:18:19,509
Also, bless those asking for fortunes and...

156
00:18:19,634 --> 00:18:23,675
ordinary people like me struggling
to eat, all the same.

157
00:18:24,009 --> 00:18:26,175
I won’t disturb you anymore.
See you tomorrow.

158
00:18:26,658 --> 00:18:27,134
Bye.

159
00:18:27,675 --> 00:18:29,675
[Song playing]

160
00:18:31,259 --> 00:18:33,674
Hey!
- Hey, get lost.

161
00:18:33,675 --> 00:18:37,217
(Singing)

162
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:40,674
Hey, get lost.

163
00:18:40,675 --> 00:18:41,925
You...

164
00:18:44,759 --> 00:18:47,134
Hey! Give me one Tea...
- No way. Get lost!

165
00:18:48,361 --> 00:18:50,236
Why are you staring at me like that?
- Okay.

166
00:18:57,217 --> 00:18:58,925
When will you give me
my money, Swatantra Babu?

167
00:19:00,384 --> 00:19:02,292
He said he'd pay. Didn't he?
- Who?

168
00:19:04,050 --> 00:19:05,259
You...

169
00:19:06,066 --> 00:19:08,217
Hey! Hey! Stop right there...

170
00:19:15,050 --> 00:19:15,634
One cigarette.

171
00:19:43,217 --> 00:19:44,717
I'm Swatantra Babu.

172
00:19:45,092 --> 00:19:45,842
Sreenu!

173
00:19:47,217 --> 00:19:50,054
Brother, in Tirupati,
90 out of 100 people are named Sreenu.

174
00:19:50,259 --> 00:19:52,134
But you look unique, like one in a hundred.

175
00:19:52,342 --> 00:19:54,634
You’ve got a divine glow on your face.

176
00:19:55,467 --> 00:19:57,467
I think you come from a respectable family.

177
00:19:59,217 --> 00:20:00,300
You’re not from Tirupati, are you?

178
00:20:00,467 --> 00:20:01,259
How’d you know?

179
00:20:01,550 --> 00:20:03,800
I make a couple of rounds around
Tirupati every single day, brother.

180
00:20:04,259 --> 00:20:07,884
There’s hardly anyone in Tirupati
I don’t recognize or know about.

181
00:20:08,050 --> 00:20:09,248
But you... this is the first time I’m seeing you.

182
00:20:09,634 --> 00:20:10,967
So, what do you do here in Tirupati?

183
00:20:11,300 --> 00:20:13,924
I spend my mornings studying people...

184
00:20:13,925 --> 00:20:19,217
and in the evening, after a drink,
I set out to change the world.

185
00:20:19,884 --> 00:20:21,175
Forget about changing the world for now.

186
00:20:21,550 --> 00:20:23,258
First, change your Tirupati, Swatantra Babu.

187
00:20:23,259 --> 00:20:24,243
What happened?

188
00:20:24,675 --> 00:20:26,118
The day I arrived in Tirupati,

189
00:20:26,342 --> 00:20:28,925
I saw someone beating up a young man
right in the middle of the road.

190
00:20:29,342 --> 00:20:30,134
What was that atrocity?

191
00:20:30,509 --> 00:20:33,592
What? You mean the incident that
happened near the MR Palli Circle?

192
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:36,342
Oh! He's Peddi Reddy.

193
00:20:36,509 --> 00:20:37,884
He was once my disciple.

194
00:20:38,550 --> 00:20:40,550
If he changes, then Tirupati will change.

195
00:20:42,092 --> 00:20:43,967
I see. But where exactly is Peddi Reddy’s house?

196
00:20:44,842 --> 00:20:45,925
Why do you ask?

197
00:20:45,967 --> 00:20:48,842
Oh... since you said he’s violent,
I wanted to see what his house would be like.

198
00:20:50,134 --> 00:20:51,259
If you’re scared, you don’t have to say it.

199
00:20:52,003 --> 00:20:52,586
Scared?

200
00:20:53,884 --> 00:20:55,550
Didn’t you read the papers recently, brother?

201
00:20:57,217 --> 00:21:02,092
According to Forest Department records,
there are 12 tigers roaming the Seshachalam forests.

202
00:21:02,967 --> 00:21:08,425
But what they don't know is that the
13th tiger is roaming right here in Tirupati.

203
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:09,800
A tiger! Where?

204
00:21:10,134 --> 00:21:10,967
Brother...

205
00:21:11,717 --> 00:21:14,092
I am that 13th tiger!

206
00:21:16,175 --> 00:21:17,884
Don't be scared, let's go.

207
00:21:18,467 --> 00:21:23,299
Though, this tiger gets a bit thirsty
in the evening; I'll need a drink.

208
00:21:23,300 --> 00:21:24,800
Please...
- Ok, let's go.

209
00:21:27,967 --> 00:21:29,634
Right, brother... Right.

210
00:21:32,384 --> 00:21:35,259
There... See that poster?
That's the house.

211
00:21:40,092 --> 00:21:41,259
Oh no! Why did you stop here, brother?

212
00:21:42,092 --> 00:21:43,009
Just wanted to take a look.

213
00:21:43,675 --> 00:21:46,509
Brother, you asked me to show you that house,
but you didn't say you'd stop the vehicle here.

214
00:21:46,800 --> 00:21:49,591
If Peddi Reddy's men spot us here,
we'll be done for, brother.

215
00:21:49,592 --> 00:21:51,008
Let's go brother... please.

216
00:21:51,009 --> 00:21:53,217
But didn't you just say you were
the thirteenth tiger of Seshachalam?

217
00:21:53,634 --> 00:21:56,341
Even a tiger shouldn't wander
into the village sometimes, brother.

218
00:21:56,342 --> 00:21:57,884
Let's go... Come on.

219
00:22:23,175 --> 00:22:25,098
Oh no! They've seen us!

220
00:22:25,421 --> 00:22:26,967
Hey, who the hell are you people?

221
00:22:27,172 --> 00:22:30,297
I'm not the thirteenth tiger, brother.
It's Peddi Reddy! Let's go!

222
00:22:30,552 --> 00:22:32,612
I know.
- Come on, let’s go.

223
00:23:11,884 --> 00:23:13,425
Hey Pallavi!
- What is it?

224
00:23:13,675 --> 00:23:17,425
That guy standing by the bike
over there... do we know him?

225
00:23:17,592 --> 00:23:18,300
Why?

226
00:23:18,467 --> 00:23:19,842
He’s staring at us as if he knows us.

227
00:23:22,634 --> 00:23:24,384
Maybe he's looking at someone else.
Let's go.

228
00:23:25,800 --> 00:23:27,050
The signal's on. Move!

229
00:23:44,675 --> 00:23:47,342
Who is this guy?
Why is he stalking us like this?

230
00:23:47,717 --> 00:23:50,967
Tirupati is full of crazy people these days.
Don’t mind him... let's go.

231
00:24:00,050 --> 00:24:00,550
How much is it?

232
00:24:00,884 --> 00:24:01,717
Rs 1000/-

233
00:24:08,842 --> 00:24:09,217
Okay.

234
00:24:18,634 --> 00:24:19,759
Hey, let's go...
- What happened?

235
00:24:20,175 --> 00:24:22,009
Hello... Excuse me.

236
00:24:22,967 --> 00:24:24,009
Do you like me?

237
00:24:25,592 --> 00:24:27,634
What are you talking about?
- Will you keep quiet?

238
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:29,759
I’m talking to her, right?

239
00:24:30,634 --> 00:24:32,300
You tell me.
Do you like me?

240
00:24:33,759 --> 00:24:34,717
What do you mean "like you"?

241
00:24:35,050 --> 00:24:37,300
Then why have you been
following me since the signal?

242
00:24:37,592 --> 00:24:38,842
I’m not following you!

243
00:24:39,009 --> 00:24:40,717
You’re completely misunderstanding the situation.

244
00:24:40,800 --> 00:24:42,800
Let's say the first signal was a misunderstanding.

245
00:24:43,217 --> 00:24:45,050
Let's assume the second signal was one too.

246
00:24:45,300 --> 00:24:46,009
What about this shop?

247
00:24:47,509 --> 00:24:49,759
Staring at my back in this shop...
is that a misunderstanding as well?

248
00:24:49,967 --> 00:24:50,509
Hello!

249
00:24:50,675 --> 00:24:52,424
We weren't looking at your back.

250
00:24:52,425 --> 00:24:54,342
Besides, there's nothing special to look at.

251
00:24:54,367 --> 00:24:54,825
See?

252
00:24:55,259 --> 00:24:57,050
That means you did look!

253
00:24:57,342 --> 00:24:58,800
We came here to buy a mobile pouch.

254
00:24:59,134 --> 00:25:00,717
Go ask the shopkeeper if you don’t believe us.

255
00:25:00,842 --> 00:25:02,759
Yeah, right. Everyone who gets
caught says exactly the same thing.

256
00:25:02,884 --> 00:25:03,591
What?!

257
00:25:03,592 --> 00:25:08,384
Look... there's nothing wrong with liking someone,
checking them out, or even following them.

258
00:25:08,800 --> 00:25:12,300
But denying it when you're asked
outright... that's what's wrong.

259
00:25:14,092 --> 00:25:15,342
Are you embarrassed
because your friend is here?

260
00:25:15,550 --> 00:25:16,634
Should I give you my number?

261
00:25:17,050 --> 00:25:17,592
Hello!

262
00:25:17,842 --> 00:25:19,300
Do you have any idea who she’s related to?

263
00:25:19,717 --> 00:25:21,009
Do you know who I am?

264
00:25:21,425 --> 00:25:22,467
Why are we even arguing?

265
00:25:23,342 --> 00:25:23,967
Let's just go.

266
00:25:24,092 --> 00:25:26,092
Won't you let newcomers
to Tirupati live in peace?

267
00:25:26,342 --> 00:25:27,634
Don't you have brothers?

268
00:25:28,763 --> 00:25:31,055
Why are you troubling us
in a holy place like this?

269
00:25:31,967 --> 00:25:32,634
Come on, let's go.

270
00:25:44,759 --> 00:25:47,924
"Ye Manga Hey Manga,
you are definitely an angel,"

271
00:25:47,925 --> 00:25:50,925
"from which celestial world did you fall down from?"

272
00:25:51,634 --> 00:25:54,716
"Ye Manga Hey Manga, as this Sreenu is blessed,"

273
00:25:54,717 --> 00:25:57,800
"you have arrived on these Seven hills."

274
00:25:58,425 --> 00:26:02,049
"I have closed my nose and taken dip,
I have grown lean,"

275
00:26:02,050 --> 00:26:04,925
"I have performed many prayers."

276
00:26:05,300 --> 00:26:11,634
"You wore your wings and descended like the nectar,
and filled my life with brightness."

277
00:26:12,050 --> 00:26:18,759
"I am not one among the thousand,
I am the one who has filled his heart with you."

278
00:26:19,175 --> 00:26:25,883
"You were born for me,
I will die in your absence."

279
00:26:25,884 --> 00:26:29,466
"The eyes Manga sees through belong to me,
Manga's teeth belong to me,"

280
00:26:29,467 --> 00:26:32,716
"Manga's whole body is mine,
and I will store you in me."

281
00:26:32,717 --> 00:26:36,258
"Manga, I will get my head shaved,
I will roll on the floor during prayers,"

282
00:26:36,259 --> 00:26:39,259
"Manga, I will observe fasting for you,
because I am in love with you."

283
00:27:03,342 --> 00:27:08,884
"Every path you are walking is calling out to me."

284
00:27:10,467 --> 00:27:15,592
"Every breath of yours is evident in this air."

285
00:27:17,050 --> 00:27:23,841
"If you have a heart in you,
you can hear the chaos in my heart."

286
00:27:23,842 --> 00:27:31,133
"If you have some love in you,
you can see my love that is all around you."

287
00:27:31,134 --> 00:27:34,633
"Manga, I will massage your legs,
Manga, I will braid your hair,"

288
00:27:34,634 --> 00:27:37,799
"Manga, I will kiss you every minute."

289
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:41,258
"Manga, don't remove me,
Manga, don't push me away,"

290
00:27:41,259 --> 00:27:44,716
"Manga, don't slice me,
I will come back every time."

291
00:27:44,717 --> 00:27:46,299
"Ye Manga Hey Manga,"

292
00:27:46,300 --> 00:27:50,925
"When will your hands feed me
those cute tiny rice balls?"

293
00:27:51,550 --> 00:27:53,341
"Ye Manga Hey Manga,"

294
00:27:53,342 --> 00:27:57,592
'when will you rest your head
on my lap and converse with me?"

295
00:27:58,509 --> 00:28:04,384
"If you agree to it, I will marry you,
I will build a temple to worship you."

296
00:28:05,550 --> 00:28:11,342
"If we are blessed with a child,
we will name him Venkatesulu."

297
00:28:12,342 --> 00:28:15,633
"You and I are one and my heart belongs to you,"

298
00:28:15,634 --> 00:28:18,925
"all you have to say is this,
even if it is for a moment."

299
00:28:19,175 --> 00:28:26,008
"No matter who says what,
I will be with you, only with you, till the end."

300
00:28:26,009 --> 00:28:29,424
"The eyes Manga sees through belong to me,
Manga's teeth belong to me,"

301
00:28:29,425 --> 00:28:32,674
"Manga's whole body is mine,
and I will store you in me."

302
00:28:32,675 --> 00:28:36,216
"Manga, I will get my head shaved,
I will roll on the floor during prayers,"

303
00:28:36,217 --> 00:28:39,217
"Manga, I will observe fasting for you,
because I am in love with you."

304
00:28:39,259 --> 00:28:41,300
Manga...!

305
00:28:41,967 --> 00:28:44,639
Sister, we have holidays now...
let’s go somewhere.

306
00:28:44,925 --> 00:28:47,092
Where shall I take you all?

307
00:28:49,009 --> 00:28:50,425
How about going to Aunt Varalakshmi’s place?

308
00:28:50,592 --> 00:28:51,967
Yes! Let's go! Let's go!

309
00:28:52,509 --> 00:28:53,675
Come on, let's go ask.

310
00:28:54,175 --> 00:28:55,009
I'll come.
- Uncle!

311
00:28:56,425 --> 00:28:57,092
I'll call you back.

312
00:28:58,467 --> 00:28:59,009
Yes, tell me?

313
00:28:59,342 --> 00:29:00,967
Since the kids have holidays,

314
00:29:01,259 --> 00:29:05,175
Mom and Aunt are suggesting
we visit Aunt Varalakshmi’s place.

315
00:29:05,592 --> 00:29:06,384
Sure, go ahead.

316
00:29:07,175 --> 00:29:08,759
But just inform your father before you leave.

317
00:29:11,217 --> 00:29:14,384
My father is something else.
For everything, he just says, 'Ask your father.'

318
00:29:15,175 --> 00:29:15,800
Let’s ask.

319
00:29:21,884 --> 00:29:23,342
Daddy!
- Yes, tell me?

320
00:29:24,717 --> 00:29:26,717
The kids have their school holidays.

321
00:29:27,092 --> 00:29:29,592
We’re thinking of visiting Aunt Varalakshmi’s house.

322
00:29:34,467 --> 00:29:35,342
There’s no need for that, ma.

323
00:29:35,842 --> 00:29:37,300
We’ll invite Aunt here in a few days.

324
00:29:39,384 --> 00:29:39,925
You may go now.

325
00:29:50,092 --> 00:29:51,759
Hey Sreenu... who is he?

326
00:29:52,384 --> 00:29:53,550
That’s my friend, Swatantra Babu.

327
00:29:54,092 --> 00:29:56,092
You've been here just two days,
and you've already made a friend?

328
00:29:57,050 --> 00:29:58,009
Sir! you...

329
00:29:58,217 --> 00:30:03,217
[Singing song]

330
00:30:08,217 --> 00:30:09,634
You're Singer Balu, aren't you?

331
00:30:11,217 --> 00:30:14,134
Oh my god... I’m your biggest fan, sir!

332
00:30:14,300 --> 00:30:16,299
Good evening, sir!

333
00:30:16,300 --> 00:30:17,300
Do you know me?

334
00:30:17,384 --> 00:30:19,134
Sir, how could I not know you?

335
00:30:19,425 --> 00:30:22,133
When Yatam Subba Rao died in the
second street of Gandhi Nagar,

336
00:30:22,134 --> 00:30:23,384
you came and sang, didn't you, sir?

337
00:30:23,842 --> 00:30:25,716
I didn't cry because he died...

338
00:30:25,717 --> 00:30:26,175
Then?

339
00:30:26,259 --> 00:30:29,758
I cried so hard after hearing you sing,
I even threw up, sir.

340
00:30:29,759 --> 00:30:30,216
What?!

341
00:30:30,217 --> 00:30:32,009
Sir... you sang so beautifully, sir!

342
00:30:32,467 --> 00:30:33,259
Okay.

343
00:30:33,634 --> 00:30:34,009
Sir!

344
00:30:34,300 --> 00:30:35,175
If you don't mind...

345
00:30:35,550 --> 00:30:37,607
Sir, if you don't mind,
may I have a peg?

346
00:30:38,092 --> 00:30:39,759
Just one.
- Yeah, Please...

347
00:30:39,967 --> 00:30:40,675
Thank you sir.

348
00:30:41,092 --> 00:30:41,884
Just one.

349
00:30:42,925 --> 00:30:45,217
Sreenu, there's beer in the fridge,
help yourself to one too.

350
00:30:47,342 --> 00:30:49,884
Just call me Balu.
No need for all the "sir."

351
00:30:50,092 --> 00:30:51,217
I'm Gen Z too.

352
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:53,342
I have a lot of respect for you, Balu.

353
00:30:53,675 --> 00:30:55,592
I simply can’t address you informally.

354
00:30:56,009 --> 00:30:57,092
You’re quite an energetic fellow.

355
00:30:57,550 --> 00:30:58,884
Are you married, Swatantra Babu?

356
00:31:03,592 --> 00:31:04,925
It’s a long story.

357
00:31:05,467 --> 00:31:07,592
Then grab a strong drink and make it short.

358
00:31:12,134 --> 00:31:16,300
The first time I went to see a prospective bride,
they asked us to talk in private.

359
00:31:17,675 --> 00:31:22,342
She told me she was in love with someone else
and asked me to reject the match

360
00:31:23,717 --> 00:31:24,550
and what did you do?

361
00:31:24,967 --> 00:31:25,884
I did exactly what she asked.

362
00:31:29,134 --> 00:31:32,675
After that, I married another girl.
It was our wedding night.

363
00:31:33,759 --> 00:31:35,759
The girl walked in with a glass of milk and said,

364
00:31:38,134 --> 00:31:43,217
"I love someone else and I’m
eloping tomorrow; please forgive me."

365
00:31:44,925 --> 00:31:48,217
I told her, "Elope right now," and let her go.

366
00:31:55,467 --> 00:31:58,592
A man’s desires never really die, right?
That’s why I married again.

367
00:31:58,967 --> 00:32:00,967
Did she also tell you she loved someone else?

368
00:32:01,217 --> 00:32:03,384
Oh, she didn't tell me, brother.

369
00:32:04,717 --> 00:32:05,217
Then?

370
00:32:05,967 --> 00:32:12,175
I overheard her on the phone with her lover,
discussing how to kill me!

371
00:32:13,175 --> 00:32:16,966
I told her, "Why ruin someone's
life just to get married?

372
00:32:16,967 --> 00:32:18,967
Go be with the man you love."

373
00:32:21,717 --> 00:32:26,967
Since then, I decided it doesn't matter if I don't
have a wife; as long as I have my life, that's enough...

374
00:32:28,800 --> 00:32:29,592
ugh, no no...

375
00:32:30,175 --> 00:32:32,550
I’ve been living a very simple life, on my own.

376
00:32:33,592 --> 00:32:35,134
That’s very unfortunate.

377
00:32:35,550 --> 00:32:37,134
That's not it, Swatantra Babu.

378
00:32:38,050 --> 00:32:41,175
When three different women
told you they loved someone else...

379
00:32:42,175 --> 00:32:43,259
how did you react?

380
00:32:43,884 --> 00:32:44,759
Come on, Balu.

381
00:32:45,092 --> 00:32:47,342
Even Kamal Haasan couldn't
pull off that reaction!

382
00:32:49,842 --> 00:32:50,384
True.

383
00:32:50,863 --> 00:32:53,009
Despite knowing there are plenty of girls out there,

384
00:32:53,342 --> 00:32:57,967
our Sreenu is roaming around with this girl here,
completely ignoring everything else, Balu sir!

385
00:32:58,134 --> 00:32:59,300
Sreenu... who is that girl?

386
00:33:01,925 --> 00:33:05,175
If you find out who she is,
there'll be a tune in your throat...

387
00:33:06,323 --> 00:33:07,823
Tell me!

388
00:33:08,634 --> 00:33:10,134
This is my sleep time...

389
00:33:11,342 --> 00:33:12,217
Good night!

390
00:33:12,884 --> 00:33:15,259
I have many aunties waiting for me.

391
00:33:15,717 --> 00:33:16,717
Aunties?!

392
00:33:17,467 --> 00:33:18,092
Where?

393
00:33:18,467 --> 00:33:19,634
On the temple steps!

394
00:33:21,384 --> 00:33:23,175
Ugh, damn you... yuck!

395
00:33:32,300 --> 00:33:33,384
Do you like me?

396
00:33:34,550 --> 00:33:36,550
I told you to stop following me.

397
00:33:36,925 --> 00:33:38,592
Don't follow me anymore.

398
00:33:39,300 --> 00:33:41,300
Don't follow me anymore.

399
00:33:42,259 --> 00:33:45,550
I... I wasn't following you...
I wasn't following you...

400
00:33:45,967 --> 00:33:48,634
I... I wasn't following you...
I wasn't following you...

401
00:33:54,050 --> 00:33:54,925
Manga!

402
00:33:56,262 --> 00:33:58,012
Manga! What happened, dear?

403
00:34:02,342 --> 00:34:03,967
Traffic... traffic...

404
00:34:04,884 --> 00:34:05,592
traffic...

405
00:34:05,889 --> 00:34:06,597
traffic...

406
00:34:06,967 --> 00:34:08,550
What happened, sister? What's wrong?

407
00:34:08,884 --> 00:34:10,967
Look how she's drenched in sweat.

408
00:34:12,259 --> 00:34:14,634
I told her not to travel by bikes and buses,
but she never listens.

409
00:34:15,009 --> 00:34:17,092
Don’t we have enough money?
Don’t we have enough cars?

410
00:34:17,550 --> 00:34:21,049
Now look... some evil eye must have struck her,
or some bad luck has caught up.

411
00:34:21,050 --> 00:34:21,842
Hey! Shut your mouth!

412
00:34:22,342 --> 00:34:24,217
Let her live exactly as she pleases.

413
00:34:24,467 --> 00:34:24,883
Okay.

414
00:34:24,884 --> 00:34:26,217
How many times must I tell you?

415
00:34:27,425 --> 00:34:28,384
Everyone, get out of here!

416
00:34:34,967 --> 00:34:36,842
I... I just prefer being like this, Father.

417
00:34:37,013 --> 00:34:38,013
What happened, my child?

418
00:34:38,675 --> 00:34:41,259
Just a bad dream, Father...

419
00:34:42,509 --> 00:34:44,717
Didn't I tell you not to overthink things?

420
00:34:45,634 --> 00:34:47,175
Just live your life the way you want.

421
00:34:47,717 --> 00:34:49,717
If any trouble comes your way, you tell me.

422
00:34:50,384 --> 00:34:50,842
Alright?

423
00:34:52,300 --> 00:34:53,134
Go back to sleep...

424
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:13,259
[Indistinct chatter]

425
00:35:19,384 --> 00:35:20,842
Hello... who are you?

426
00:35:20,884 --> 00:35:22,591
The teacher asked me to come urgently...
he wanted to talk to me about something.

427
00:35:22,592 --> 00:35:23,467
Who is that teacher?

428
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:26,800
Hello, hello... who are you?

429
00:35:26,967 --> 00:35:29,467
I’m the recipient of the 1988–89 Nandi Award.

430
00:35:30,134 --> 00:35:31,217
For which play?

431
00:35:32,317 --> 00:35:33,400
'Tirigirani Pativrata'
[The sacred Wife Who Never Returned!]

432
00:35:33,683 --> 00:35:34,725
You wouldn’t have even been born back then.

433
00:35:38,175 --> 00:35:39,467
This is the dialogue here, right?

434
00:35:43,342 --> 00:35:44,175
Come, let's sit here.

435
00:35:49,675 --> 00:35:50,634
Which area are you from?

436
00:35:54,175 --> 00:35:55,009
Mangalampalli?

437
00:35:57,842 --> 00:35:58,967
Or the Leela Mahal area?

438
00:36:03,175 --> 00:36:07,509
Just tell me where exactly;
I'll be there in two minutes.

439
00:36:08,425 --> 00:36:09,717
No, it's Police Lines.

440
00:36:13,467 --> 00:36:14,634
I won't come all the way out there.

441
00:36:15,884 --> 00:36:17,300
Manga! Ready?

442
00:36:17,634 --> 00:36:19,634
Getting late...
rehearsal, guys!

443
00:36:21,717 --> 00:36:22,259
Vamsi!

444
00:36:25,592 --> 00:36:26,550
Are you leaving?

445
00:36:27,175 --> 00:36:27,925
Is this it?

446
00:36:28,884 --> 00:36:30,134
Are we really separating forever?

447
00:36:32,790 --> 00:36:35,332
These days, even many married
couples are breaking apart.

448
00:36:35,759 --> 00:36:38,009
We just loved each other, that’s all.

449
00:36:38,550 --> 00:36:40,009
"Just" loved each other?

450
00:36:41,050 --> 00:36:46,050
How can you dismiss our years of love in
a single moment with the word "just," Vamsi?

451
00:36:46,634 --> 00:36:47,675
It’s hard for you...

452
00:36:48,217 --> 00:36:49,009
I know, Pavani.

453
00:36:49,925 --> 00:36:51,925
But we have no choice.
You must forget.

454
00:36:52,384 --> 00:37:00,033
I might be able to forget the whole world,
but I can... never forget you.

455
00:37:01,050 --> 00:37:01,967
Don’t you understand when I tell you?

456
00:37:02,717 --> 00:37:04,800
Time heals all wounds.

457
00:37:05,759 --> 00:37:07,759
But time doesn't heal wounds, Vamsi...

458
00:37:08,842 --> 00:37:10,842
it keeps them alive in the form of your memories...

459
00:37:20,509 --> 00:37:21,759
Come on, Manga... come on.

460
00:37:26,592 --> 00:37:28,217
As memories of you...

461
00:37:33,925 --> 00:37:35,009
What is this Manga?

462
00:37:35,425 --> 00:37:36,467
You aren't doing a good job.

463
00:37:36,717 --> 00:37:39,384
If you can’t perform the role properly,
why not give the character to someone else?

464
00:37:40,050 --> 00:37:41,841
Look, Manga, I'm losing
my confidence because of you...

465
00:37:41,842 --> 00:37:42,966
You act like you're some legendary Nana Patekar...

466
00:37:42,967 --> 00:37:45,675
you're just reciting lines without
giving them any real expression.

467
00:37:46,467 --> 00:37:48,467
We don’t have much time, Pallavi...
you know that, right?

468
00:37:48,925 --> 00:37:50,259
Manga is not getting it right.

469
00:38:03,592 --> 00:38:04,656
Why are you leaving?

470
00:38:05,925 --> 00:38:06,865
you're actually doing very well.

471
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:09,175
But you're afraid of something.

472
00:38:09,425 --> 00:38:10,550
I can see it in your eyes.

473
00:38:11,217 --> 00:38:13,384
If you can just let go of that fear,
no one will be able to match your performance.

474
00:38:17,592 --> 00:38:18,259
Did I ask you?

475
00:38:18,759 --> 00:38:19,675
Did I ask for your opinion?

476
00:38:20,717 --> 00:38:23,925
Who are you to tell me whether I did well or not?

477
00:38:24,532 --> 00:38:25,199
Are you my friend?

478
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:26,550
My teacher?

479
00:38:27,050 --> 00:38:28,175
Or a family member?

480
00:38:29,467 --> 00:38:31,717
Why are you following me around
and annoying me like this?

481
00:38:32,134 --> 00:38:34,134
Me? You’re the one who keeps coming after me.

482
00:38:35,675 --> 00:38:36,259
Stop it.

483
00:38:37,550 --> 00:38:37,906
Enough.

484
00:38:43,134 --> 00:38:43,925
Manga!

485
00:38:56,259 --> 00:38:56,842
Hey...

486
00:38:58,134 --> 00:38:59,050
What did you just blabber?

487
00:38:59,717 --> 00:39:00,425
What rubbish are you talking?

488
00:39:02,134 --> 00:39:03,175
Hey, what’s going on here?

489
00:39:03,342 --> 00:39:05,342
Brother, this guy is bothering Manga.

490
00:39:05,967 --> 00:39:07,299
So you’re all Peddireddy’s men?

491
00:39:07,300 --> 00:39:09,217
Exactly. So what are you going to do about it?

492
00:39:09,925 --> 00:39:12,300
What’s your name?
Where are you from?

493
00:39:12,800 --> 00:39:13,550
Where do you live?

494
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:15,592
Why, brother?
Are you planning on sending me a gift?

495
00:39:17,509 --> 00:39:21,884
If you show your face here again,
whether on the hill or under it...

496
00:39:22,425 --> 00:39:24,050
your body will be the one returning home.

497
00:39:25,384 --> 00:39:26,050
Look, brother...

498
00:39:26,634 --> 00:39:28,092
I usually don't go looking for trouble.

499
00:39:28,800 --> 00:39:33,342
But if someone messes with me,
I won’t stop until I’ve smashed them to pieces.

500
00:39:37,300 --> 00:39:39,223
I swear on Lord venkateswara!

501
00:39:39,467 --> 00:39:43,134
If I can’t lay my hands on at least one of you,
I’ll leave Tirupati myself!

502
00:40:13,634 --> 00:40:16,259
How could you throw burning coals
at my beautiful face?

503
00:42:20,842 --> 00:42:23,467
Manga! Come here for a moment, dear.

504
00:42:30,217 --> 00:42:32,134
Did anyone bother you near
the class yesterday?

505
00:42:37,259 --> 00:42:38,134
No, uncle.

506
00:42:38,592 --> 00:42:41,759
But our people said they saw
someone troubling you yesterday?

507
00:42:42,759 --> 00:42:44,134
He’s just a friend, uncle.

508
00:42:45,425 --> 00:42:46,509
Alright, you go now.

509
00:42:49,550 --> 00:42:51,217
She says he's her friend.

510
00:42:51,592 --> 00:42:53,717
How can you just rush in without
even knowing who he is?

511
00:42:54,050 --> 00:42:56,134
Inside, the DSP is telling Brother
exactly the same thing.

512
00:42:57,550 --> 00:43:00,342
Stay out of trouble and avoid any
scuffles for a while.

513
00:43:00,967 --> 00:43:01,550
Now go.

514
00:43:01,884 --> 00:43:03,425
It’s not just Narayanappa, sir.

515
00:43:03,634 --> 00:43:06,509
There are many people in Tirupati waiting for
the right chance to get even with you.

516
00:43:07,425 --> 00:43:08,884
I’ll handle all of that myself.

517
00:43:10,342 --> 00:43:15,175
It’s been over a year since I filed a complaint
about my missing licensed revolver.

518
00:43:16,592 --> 00:43:18,759
Have you found out anything about it?

519
00:43:19,300 --> 00:43:20,009
No, sir.

520
00:43:21,092 --> 00:43:23,092
That gun is a family heirloom.

521
00:43:23,509 --> 00:43:26,884
My grandfather gave it to my father,
and my father passed it down to me.

522
00:43:27,884 --> 00:43:30,842
Make finding it your priority, DSP.

523
00:43:31,467 --> 00:43:32,300
Understood, sir.

524
00:43:33,634 --> 00:43:34,592
I’ll take your leave.

525
00:44:02,925 --> 00:44:04,467
but I can never forget you.

526
00:44:05,342 --> 00:44:06,425
Don’t you understand when I tell you?

527
00:44:08,217 --> 00:44:09,592
Time heals all wounds.

528
00:44:11,217 --> 00:44:13,217
But time doesn't heal wounds, Vamsi...

529
00:44:13,759 --> 00:44:15,342
it keeps them alive in the form of your memories...

530
00:44:43,425 --> 00:44:44,800
Hey, who are you?

531
00:44:45,050 --> 00:44:45,807
Hey, move aside.

532
00:44:46,550 --> 00:44:46,967
Get lost.

533
00:44:51,136 --> 00:44:52,303
You must forget everything.

534
00:44:52,967 --> 00:44:54,842
Forget every moment we spent together...

535
00:44:56,059 --> 00:44:58,059
Forget the countless hours we spent talking.

536
00:44:58,771 --> 00:45:00,025
Forget that we ever even met.

537
00:45:01,425 --> 00:45:04,092
Forget that someone like me
even walked into your life.

538
00:45:06,765 --> 00:45:07,598
Can't you forget?

539
00:45:10,042 --> 00:45:10,625
Say something!

540
00:45:14,936 --> 00:45:16,936
Time doesn't heal wounds, Vamsi...

541
00:45:17,649 --> 00:45:21,941
In the form of your memories,
it haunts me and kills me every single day.

542
00:45:22,711 --> 00:45:24,461
How can I make you understand?

543
00:45:26,550 --> 00:45:28,925
We first met at a wedding.

544
00:45:29,092 --> 00:45:31,675
and now even the word 'wedding'
only brings back memories of you.

545
00:45:34,352 --> 00:45:35,644
You proposed to me in a temple.

546
00:45:36,519 --> 00:45:39,144
Now, every time I step into a temple,
I’m reminded of you.

547
00:45:41,061 --> 00:45:42,727
Your very first touch...

548
00:45:43,311 --> 00:45:44,977
our first kiss...

549
00:45:45,644 --> 00:45:48,061
every single place we ever went together...

550
00:45:49,168 --> 00:45:51,168
no matter where I go, all I see is you.

551
00:45:53,049 --> 00:45:53,965
Do one thing...

552
00:45:55,269 --> 00:45:56,686
Since you’re the one who loved me,

553
00:45:57,811 --> 00:45:59,811
teach me how to forget you, too.

554
00:46:02,686 --> 00:46:03,894
But you can’t, can you?

555
00:46:05,894 --> 00:46:09,352
Dying isn't just about losing one's life, Vamsi.

556
00:46:09,852 --> 00:46:16,311
Real death is when the person you love more
than life itself stands right in front of you,

557
00:46:17,311 --> 00:46:18,311
acting as if nothing ever happened.

558
00:46:20,602 --> 00:46:23,477
But, I can't live like that, Vamsi.

559
00:46:24,852 --> 00:46:26,644
My very last memory...

560
00:46:28,811 --> 00:46:30,394
should be of your form.

561
00:46:46,686 --> 00:46:49,519
Manga, that was incredible!
You were amazing.

562
00:46:50,727 --> 00:46:53,102
You reminded us of the old Manga...

563
00:46:53,769 --> 00:46:55,269
those expressions were so natural!

564
00:46:55,519 --> 00:46:58,436
Truly amazing, so natural.
You did a great job.

565
00:47:01,519 --> 00:47:02,519
Just a minute...
- Yeah, sure.

566
00:47:02,936 --> 00:47:06,060
I honestly didn't expect it...
Manga did a fantastic job.

567
00:47:06,061 --> 00:47:06,686
Thank you.

568
00:47:07,311 --> 00:47:10,477
Leave all that aside, I have one doubt...

569
00:47:11,311 --> 00:47:13,186
Have you ever been in love before?

570
00:47:18,727 --> 00:47:19,352
Who knows...

571
00:47:40,936 --> 00:47:45,811
Brother, that girl has developed
a great opinion of you!

572
00:47:50,686 --> 00:47:52,561
What are you going to do now?

573
00:47:52,769 --> 00:47:54,186
It's simple, Swatantram.

574
00:47:54,436 --> 00:47:55,893
I'll go to Manga and say,

575
00:47:55,894 --> 00:47:59,977
I understand how much you love me
since you've been following me for so long.

576
00:48:00,561 --> 00:48:02,644
I accept your love.

577
00:48:03,436 --> 00:48:04,811
Manga will be thrilled.

578
00:48:04,977 --> 00:48:09,186
Then, Manga and I will roam all over
Tirupati like a pair of lovebirds for a few days.

579
00:48:09,561 --> 00:48:12,311
Sooner or later, some useless fellow
will pass the news to Peddireddy.

580
00:48:13,852 --> 00:48:15,602
That’s when Manga and
I will be forced to elope.

581
00:48:16,883 --> 00:48:20,550
And in his anger over his daughter running away
with me, Peddireddy will kill Balu for giving me shelter...

582
00:48:20,644 --> 00:48:23,686
and you, just for being my friend.

583
00:48:24,852 --> 00:48:26,311
In our grief over your deaths,

584
00:48:26,602 --> 00:48:28,894
Manga and I will get married
with your photos placed beside us.

585
00:48:29,811 --> 00:48:33,769
Now that we’re married,
we’re bound to have a kid sooner or later.

586
00:48:33,811 --> 00:48:34,519
If that happens...

587
00:48:34,644 --> 00:48:37,019
If it’s a boy, I’ll name him after you,
Swatantra Babu.

588
00:48:39,394 --> 00:48:43,811
Then, I’ll take the little one, place him at
Pedda Reddy's feet, and ask for forgiveness.

589
00:48:44,061 --> 00:48:49,186
Overjoyed to see his grandson, Peddi Reddy will
soften and embrace me as his "son-in-law."

590
00:48:49,394 --> 00:48:49,936
That's it!

591
00:48:49,977 --> 00:48:50,727
What?!

592
00:48:50,936 --> 00:48:53,727
You two will unite, and I have to die?

593
00:48:54,061 --> 00:48:56,186
Well, love does demand sacrifice, Swatantram.

594
00:49:00,936 --> 00:49:01,644
Sreenu!

595
00:49:02,798 --> 00:49:03,382
She is here.

596
00:49:06,769 --> 00:49:08,477
Do you know how long
I've been looking for you?

597
00:49:08,727 --> 00:49:09,352
Why?

598
00:49:11,644 --> 00:49:13,269
My engagement is the day after tomorrow...

599
00:49:14,186 --> 00:49:15,561
you must come.

600
00:49:23,727 --> 00:49:27,602
I don't think my brother heard you...
tell him once more, dear.

601
00:49:28,144 --> 00:49:31,144
My engagement is the day after tomorrow...
you must come.

602
00:49:31,311 --> 00:49:32,561
What’s with the sudden engagement?

603
00:49:33,061 --> 00:49:34,477
It's not sudden at all.

604
00:49:35,186 --> 00:49:38,852
Talks have been going on for a long time.
I'm just telling you now.

605
00:49:39,102 --> 00:49:40,477
Are you doing this of your own will?

606
00:49:41,061 --> 00:49:44,352
Why would I give you a card
if I didn't want this?

607
00:49:44,727 --> 00:49:46,019
You must come, Sreenu.

608
00:49:46,894 --> 00:49:49,769
I will personally bring him there, dear.
You can go.

609
00:49:50,394 --> 00:49:50,936
Bye.

610
00:50:35,769 --> 00:50:36,936
Where did you swipe this from?

611
00:50:38,769 --> 00:50:40,477
I earned this with my own sweat and blood, sir...

612
00:51:04,102 --> 00:51:07,894
Look at that! Even the engagement is wrapping up.

613
00:51:08,894 --> 00:51:11,102
So what do we do now?

614
00:51:11,769 --> 00:51:13,102
It’s just a ring he put on her finger.

615
00:51:13,811 --> 00:51:15,852
If I pawn it off, it’ll cover my honeymoon expenses.

616
00:51:16,811 --> 00:51:17,852
Manga is mine!

617
00:51:18,785 --> 00:51:21,077
No matter what happens,
I am the one who will marry her.

618
00:51:22,800 --> 00:51:23,800
Manga belongs only to me!

619
00:51:41,091 --> 00:51:44,841
The play is in five days!
And yeah, I’m feeling confident.

620
00:51:53,008 --> 00:51:54,675
Sister, pass it over.

621
00:52:02,633 --> 00:52:03,425
For me?

622
00:52:06,883 --> 00:52:08,425
Hey, Manga...

623
00:52:09,883 --> 00:52:10,550
Look over there.

624
00:52:19,220 --> 00:52:20,011
When did you get on?

625
00:52:29,678 --> 00:52:30,386
Thank you.

626
00:52:38,678 --> 00:52:40,011
Sreenu, come inside.

627
00:52:42,345 --> 00:52:44,761
Just like your heart, there's no
place for me on this bus either.

628
00:52:45,095 --> 00:52:45,720
What?

629
00:52:46,720 --> 00:52:47,511
Nothing.

630
00:52:48,761 --> 00:52:50,553
Are you moving to America after getting married?

631
00:52:51,386 --> 00:52:52,011
Yeah!

632
00:52:53,470 --> 00:52:55,928
I feel like crushing the guy who
approved her American visa.

633
00:52:58,011 --> 00:53:00,178
If you leave, who will be my friend in Tirupati?

634
00:53:04,470 --> 00:53:07,720
Speaking of friends, am I even on your friends list?

635
00:53:08,970 --> 00:53:10,470
Why bring all that up now?

636
00:53:11,095 --> 00:53:13,928
Please, Manga.
At least put me in your Top 20.

637
00:53:15,095 --> 00:53:16,178
Sreenu...

638
00:53:16,761 --> 00:53:19,220
Please, please, please.

639
00:53:19,595 --> 00:53:21,428
I have very few friends, Sreenu.

640
00:53:22,678 --> 00:53:24,345
Forget the Top 20...

641
00:53:26,345 --> 00:53:27,761
you'd easily make my Top 10.

642
00:53:36,095 --> 00:53:39,261
Just wait and see, Manga. By the time
you get married, I'll be your Number One.

643
00:53:39,678 --> 00:53:43,053
Forget Number One for now.
Come inside first.

644
00:53:43,595 --> 00:53:44,636
I’m fine right here.

645
00:53:47,303 --> 00:53:48,720
By the way, when is your birthday?

646
00:53:49,136 --> 00:53:50,261
October 3rd.

647
00:53:51,011 --> 00:53:52,511
Aren't you going to ask me when my birthday is?

648
00:53:53,136 --> 00:53:55,095
Tell me, when is your birthday?
- Tomorrow.

649
00:53:55,511 --> 00:53:58,178
Oh, happy birthday in advance, Sreenu!

650
00:53:59,553 --> 00:54:00,678
No thanks.

651
00:54:01,303 --> 00:54:02,011
Why, what happened?

652
00:54:02,470 --> 00:54:04,011
I want to take you somewhere tomorrow.

653
00:54:04,428 --> 00:54:06,261
If you promise to come, I’ll accept your "thanks."

654
00:54:11,886 --> 00:54:12,595
Okay.

655
00:54:14,678 --> 00:54:15,636
Let's meet tomorrow.

656
00:54:47,886 --> 00:54:48,470
Shall we go?

657
00:55:16,011 --> 00:55:17,553
This place is amazing, Sreenu!

658
00:55:18,011 --> 00:55:23,761
I've lived in Tirupati since I was a child,
and I never even knew a place like this existed here.

659
00:55:25,178 --> 00:55:26,011
Manga...

660
00:55:27,636 --> 00:55:31,636
Right here, right now...
what exactly are you feeling?

661
00:55:32,178 --> 00:55:33,595
I feel completely blank, Sreenu.

662
00:55:34,511 --> 00:55:37,553
There are no thoughts in my head,
no worries in my heart.

663
00:55:38,286 --> 00:55:39,220
Everything just feels so peaceful.

664
00:55:39,720 --> 00:55:43,136
Shall I do something that will make
you feel this way for the rest of your life?

665
00:55:43,472 --> 00:55:44,264
What is it?

666
00:55:44,886 --> 00:55:46,928
If I tell you the moment you ask,
where is the thrill in that for this Sreenu?

667
00:55:47,648 --> 00:55:48,481
Close your eyes.

668
00:55:48,720 --> 00:55:49,428
Why?

669
00:55:49,762 --> 00:55:50,762
Close your eyes.

670
00:56:12,511 --> 00:56:13,636
What are you doing?

671
00:56:18,178 --> 00:56:18,928
Manga...

672
00:56:19,728 --> 00:56:20,478
I love you.

673
00:56:34,678 --> 00:56:37,345
This isn’t some impulsive decision, Manga.

674
00:56:39,220 --> 00:56:42,970
Ever since the day I met you,
I’ve treasured every single memory in my heart

675
00:56:43,954 --> 00:56:45,954
and locked my love deep inside.

676
00:56:49,071 --> 00:56:51,071
Now, even if you say you
don't want me, I can't let you go.

677
00:56:54,136 --> 00:56:55,095
Are you out of your mind?!

678
00:56:59,625 --> 00:57:04,459
Just because I kept quiet when you
followed me around and teased me...

679
00:57:04,962 --> 00:57:06,837
just because I took it all as a joke
and put up with your antics... you thought...?

680
00:57:07,823 --> 00:57:09,448
Please, Manga, just listen to me once.

681
00:57:12,907 --> 00:57:13,907
Listen to what?!

682
00:57:14,157 --> 00:57:17,032
I treated you like a friend
because you helped me.

683
00:57:17,490 --> 00:57:23,490
Even though I’m engaged, I came with you
without even asking where we were going.

684
00:57:24,448 --> 00:57:27,907
But you brought me here with this in your mind?

685
00:57:30,157 --> 00:57:31,573
This is completely wrong!

686
00:57:33,490 --> 00:57:38,032
How could you expect me to call off a marriage
I willingly agreed to, just because you love me?

687
00:57:38,948 --> 00:57:40,323
How did you even get that thought, Sreenu?

688
00:58:03,365 --> 00:58:03,948
Stop!

689
00:58:05,823 --> 00:58:08,532
It's fine, I'll drop you near your house.
- No need. Stop!

690
00:58:19,032 --> 00:58:19,823
Let go of my hand!

691
00:58:20,323 --> 00:58:22,490
Brother! You didn’t believe me
when I told you the other day, right?

692
00:58:22,657 --> 00:58:24,073
Look at him now, he's harassing Manga!

693
00:58:26,198 --> 00:58:27,989
Manga, I'm running out of time, please...

694
00:58:27,990 --> 00:58:28,740
What time?

695
00:58:29,490 --> 00:58:30,448
First, let go of my hand!

696
00:58:31,948 --> 00:58:32,573
Leave me.

697
00:58:33,823 --> 00:58:35,823
I'm scared just looking at you, Sreenu.

698
00:58:35,948 --> 00:58:38,365
Don't ever show me
your face again... ever!

699
00:59:01,698 --> 00:59:02,615
Hey, Stop it.

700
01:03:34,740 --> 01:03:36,240
Om Namo Venkateshaya...!

701
01:03:36,490 --> 01:03:40,782
O Lord Venkatesha, protect us...
Bless us.

702
01:03:42,865 --> 01:03:45,907
Om Namo Venkateshaya...!
Om Namo Venkateshaya...!

703
01:03:48,323 --> 01:03:51,490
Sinners like us are too far from God;
we should just offer our prayers from a distance.

704
01:03:52,282 --> 01:03:53,615
If we go too close, He’ll strike us down.

705
01:03:57,355 --> 01:03:59,688
Only when we humble ourselves
before God can we live in peace.

706
01:04:03,448 --> 01:04:04,282
Who are you?

707
01:04:05,578 --> 01:04:08,994
You guys have been pleading
to see me for the past two days.

708
01:04:09,573 --> 01:04:10,282
What’s the matter?

709
01:04:10,948 --> 01:04:13,532
Didn't a group of men hack each other to death
in the sugarcane fields near Rangampeta the other day?

710
01:04:14,907 --> 01:04:16,198
The one who attacked them is our own guy.

711
01:04:18,282 --> 01:04:20,240
The severed hand over there belongs
to my younger son.

712
01:04:20,666 --> 01:04:22,166
Good heavens!

713
01:04:22,740 --> 01:04:23,698
Oh, was it you who did that?

714
01:04:23,907 --> 01:04:26,823
Peddireddy is gunning for me,
thinking I’m responsible for it.

715
01:04:27,657 --> 01:04:29,115
You people don’t look like locals from Tirupati.

716
01:04:29,490 --> 01:04:33,032
Tell me... what kind of old vendetta do you have
against Peddireddy to target his own brother?

717
01:04:33,652 --> 01:04:34,277
Peddireddy?

718
01:04:35,448 --> 01:04:36,240
Who the hell is he anyway?

719
01:04:39,323 --> 01:04:42,073
Oh damn!

720
01:04:42,615 --> 01:04:45,740
That’s like entering the Kurukshetra
war and asking who Krishna is...

721
01:04:46,073 --> 01:04:49,157
You attacked Peddi Reddy's own brother
without having any idea who you're dealing with?

722
01:04:49,990 --> 01:04:50,907
Who are you people, really?

723
01:04:52,073 --> 01:04:53,073
Who exactly are you people?

724
01:04:53,657 --> 01:04:55,115
Who exactly did you attack?

725
01:05:31,948 --> 01:05:32,782
Brother!

726
01:05:32,990 --> 01:05:33,656
How are you?

727
01:05:33,657 --> 01:05:35,115
I’m good. How about you?

728
01:05:35,573 --> 01:05:36,365
I’m doing well.

729
01:05:36,657 --> 01:05:38,615
Vara!
- Brother!

730
01:05:40,115 --> 01:05:41,156
How long have you been here?

731
01:05:41,157 --> 01:05:43,239
Sorry, brother. I got a little late.
How are you?

732
01:05:43,240 --> 01:05:43,948
I'm doing well.

733
01:05:44,198 --> 01:05:46,906
I have a small meeting.
We'll talk this evening.

734
01:05:46,907 --> 01:05:47,865
Okay.

735
01:05:54,407 --> 01:05:57,157
In ten days, we have a celebration at this house.

736
01:05:57,782 --> 01:06:00,115
Knowing that, that Narayanappa
had the nerve to pull a stunt like this.

737
01:06:00,698 --> 01:06:02,573
Stay alert for the next few days.

738
01:06:03,782 --> 01:06:07,782
After the celebration, I will personally
see to his 'final rites' (funeral).

739
01:06:11,948 --> 01:06:14,865
What a brilliant twist to our story!

740
01:06:15,865 --> 01:06:17,865
But Brother, it’s not safe for you
to be out in the open like this.

741
01:06:18,032 --> 01:06:20,115
Hey! Take Sir to the guest house
and keep him there.

742
01:06:20,407 --> 01:06:21,365
You stay there for now.

743
01:06:21,698 --> 01:06:24,948
We’ll take our time and plan
our next move carefully.

744
01:06:37,407 --> 01:06:38,947
Wow, this looks beautiful.

745
01:06:38,948 --> 01:06:39,657
This saree is great too.

746
01:06:39,782 --> 01:06:40,532
Put it aside.

747
01:06:44,407 --> 01:06:46,407
Vara, look at this one.

748
01:06:46,657 --> 01:06:48,865
It’s nice, Sister-in-law.
The color is lovely.

749
01:06:49,490 --> 01:06:51,240
Keep this one aside too.
- Sure, madam.

750
01:07:11,032 --> 01:07:11,657
Manga!

751
01:07:14,115 --> 01:07:14,823
Who is he?

752
01:07:15,698 --> 01:07:16,490
Sreenu!

753
01:07:17,240 --> 01:07:17,865
My friend.

754
01:07:21,115 --> 01:07:22,365
Where does he live?

755
01:07:54,282 --> 01:07:56,282
What's Peddi Reddy's sister
doing here?

756
01:08:07,198 --> 01:08:08,157
Where is he?

757
01:08:08,490 --> 01:08:10,240
He's upstairs,
flying kites.

758
01:08:11,115 --> 01:08:11,823
Which way are the stairs?

759
01:08:11,990 --> 01:08:12,782
That way.

760
01:08:13,032 --> 01:08:14,740
By the way, who are you?

761
01:08:26,198 --> 01:08:26,865
Who is she?

762
01:08:26,990 --> 01:08:28,364
I don't know.
She asked for Sreenu.

763
01:08:28,365 --> 01:08:29,615
I told her he was upstairs,
and she rushed up.

764
01:08:29,657 --> 01:08:30,948
She asked for Sreenu?

765
01:08:31,865 --> 01:08:33,157
She is Peddareddy’s sister!

766
01:08:33,782 --> 01:08:34,698
Peddareddy’s sister?

767
01:08:35,448 --> 01:08:36,448
Why did she come here?

768
01:08:36,948 --> 01:08:38,282
How would I know?

769
01:08:38,948 --> 01:08:40,240
Let’s go find out. Come on!

770
01:08:55,490 --> 01:08:56,240
Vasu Babu!

771
01:08:56,532 --> 01:08:58,948
Why’s she calling him Vasu Babu?
- Isn’t his name Sreenu?

772
01:09:01,983 --> 01:09:02,733
Vasu Babu!

773
01:09:17,407 --> 01:09:18,907
What are you doing here in Tirupati?

774
01:09:20,157 --> 01:09:21,948
You already know the answer.
Why do you even ask?

775
01:09:23,782 --> 01:09:26,031
We told you to stay out of Manga’s life forever.

776
01:09:26,032 --> 01:09:28,282
We told you to forget her, Vasubabu!

777
01:09:29,115 --> 01:09:29,948
Manga...

778
01:09:30,948 --> 01:09:32,032
Yes. She's Peddi Reddy's daughter.

779
01:09:33,240 --> 01:09:36,240
Peddi Reddy's daughter?
Why didn't you tell me?

780
01:09:36,657 --> 01:09:38,073
She's getting married
in just ten days.

781
01:09:38,490 --> 01:09:41,573
If my brother finds out you're in Tirupati,
he won’t let you live.

782
01:09:42,698 --> 01:09:44,698
You don't know what my brother is capable of, Vasu Babu.

783
01:09:44,823 --> 01:09:45,865
But you know what I'm capable of, don't you?

784
01:09:46,782 --> 01:09:48,907
Oh god... I’m begging you.

785
01:09:49,240 --> 01:09:51,698
Please, listen to me.
Leave Tirupati right now.

786
01:09:52,032 --> 01:09:53,698
Manga isn't meant for you, Vasu Babu.

787
01:09:53,740 --> 01:09:54,448
She is mine!

788
01:09:55,365 --> 01:09:56,490
Manga will always be mine!

789
01:09:58,865 --> 01:09:59,990
Who are you to tell me she isn't?

790
01:10:06,240 --> 01:10:08,115
The only reason I came to Tirupati...
was Manga.

791
01:10:11,615 --> 01:10:14,240
Without Manga, this Sreenu isn't leaving
Tirupati... no matter what.

792
01:10:21,782 --> 01:10:22,615
Manga is mine!

793
01:11:13,865 --> 01:11:17,157
[In Kannada]
Hey! One case of beer and two full bottles.

794
01:11:19,282 --> 01:11:20,865
[In Kannada]
₹4,500.

795
01:11:21,073 --> 01:11:22,489
How dare you ask for money!

796
01:11:22,490 --> 01:11:24,032
Can't you see who's there?

797
01:11:24,865 --> 01:11:25,615
Babu (Boss) is there.

798
01:11:25,782 --> 01:11:27,782
Who’s the "Boss"? Whose boss is he anyway?

799
01:11:27,823 --> 01:11:28,572
Brother!

800
01:11:28,573 --> 01:11:29,906
When I tell him the Boss sent me to get it,

801
01:11:29,907 --> 01:11:31,740
he has the nerve to ask
"Who's the boss? Whose boss?"

802
01:11:48,907 --> 01:11:50,157
How dare you..?

803
01:12:23,407 --> 01:12:25,282
Ballari is mine.

804
01:12:29,907 --> 01:12:31,407
We’ve come here realizing that in Ballari,

805
01:12:31,865 --> 01:12:36,282
your permission carries more weight
than the signatures of those in power.

806
01:12:36,823 --> 01:12:40,282
If you grant us the lease for Singanakallu hill,

807
01:12:41,157 --> 01:12:42,032
we will make sure to repay the favor in full.

808
01:12:42,657 --> 01:12:43,865
Forget it...

809
01:12:44,115 --> 01:12:46,740
Every time we make a deal, it's always about
splitting the shares... what's yours and what's mine.

810
01:12:47,115 --> 01:12:48,532
What I'm trying to say, brother...

811
01:12:48,948 --> 01:12:50,323
there's only one hill left.

812
01:12:50,740 --> 01:12:52,323
They're asking for a two-year lease,

813
01:12:52,865 --> 01:12:54,448
and we have three years left in power.

814
01:12:54,948 --> 01:12:59,032
Be generous this once and allow them to lease that hill.

815
01:13:25,573 --> 01:13:32,198
The town of Ballari came into existence only after
Sri Krishnadevaraya built a shrine for the Goddess here.

816
01:13:32,573 --> 01:13:39,698
Oblivious to that history, people have already
ravaged all the other hills in the name of mines and minerals.

817
01:13:40,365 --> 01:13:44,157
The villagers revere that one remaining hill
as the embodiment of the Goddess herself.

818
01:13:45,910 --> 01:13:48,493
Do not lay a finger on it, Gouda.

819
01:13:49,240 --> 01:13:51,990
Since when have you started
believing in the Goddess and God?

820
01:13:53,115 --> 01:13:56,532
Prabhakar... doesn't that sound bizarre?

821
01:14:01,948 --> 01:14:07,198
Save your cunning for the sell-out curs, not for me.

822
01:14:07,698 --> 01:14:13,157
To me, this isn’t just about a temple or a deity;
it’s about the sacred faith of the people.

823
01:14:13,698 --> 01:14:14,615
Now, get out of here!

824
01:14:14,907 --> 01:14:16,322
Look at his arrogance!

825
01:14:16,323 --> 01:14:18,407
We are being so civil,
and yet he is so incredibly rude.

826
01:14:18,823 --> 01:14:20,323
Do we really need him to get things done?

827
01:14:20,615 --> 01:14:22,572
I know exactly who can pull the strings for us.

828
01:14:22,573 --> 01:14:23,864
Let's go there. Come on!

829
01:14:23,865 --> 01:14:24,573
Shetty!

830
01:14:25,907 --> 01:14:27,490
Before you approach anyone,

831
01:14:28,282 --> 01:14:31,490
just tell them one thing...
that Venkatappa Naidu does not approve.

832
01:14:32,198 --> 01:14:34,657
If anyone dares to agree after that... by God...

833
01:14:35,365 --> 01:14:39,323
I will personally hand over that hill to you.
Come on then, you scoundrels!

834
01:14:51,187 --> 01:14:51,854
Hello!

835
01:15:01,073 --> 01:15:02,240
Where is Vasubabu?

836
01:15:45,615 --> 01:15:47,282
Hey, come on.

837
01:18:32,157 --> 01:18:33,990
You know what I love about you?

838
01:18:34,657 --> 01:18:37,240
Even when I’m beating you down
until you bleed,

839
01:18:37,532 --> 01:18:40,448
you lie there enjoying it like
some tramp lounging in bed.

840
01:18:43,485 --> 01:18:46,277
I burned the photo because that's what I saw.

841
01:18:46,823 --> 01:18:48,865
If your grandfather had been there instead,

842
01:18:49,240 --> 01:18:50,573
I'd have burned him without
a second thought!

843
01:19:02,740 --> 01:19:03,490
Vasu!

844
01:19:36,448 --> 01:19:37,782
You little punk...

845
01:19:42,323 --> 01:19:45,740
Do you think you’ve finally grown
enough of a backbone to set fire to my photo?

846
01:19:45,860 --> 01:19:46,485
Mr Naidu...

847
01:19:51,490 --> 01:19:54,698
Even a beggar would be ashamed
to come back for more like this.

848
01:19:54,990 --> 01:19:56,782
You don’t even have the
dignity of a common street-dweller.

849
01:19:56,990 --> 01:19:59,907
How many more times do
I have to spare your miserable life?

850
01:20:00,115 --> 01:20:01,323
What "favor" are you talking about?

851
01:20:01,865 --> 01:20:03,157
Are you the only one allowed to live in this town?

852
01:20:03,365 --> 01:20:04,407
Do the rest of us have no right to exist?

853
01:20:04,990 --> 01:20:06,990
Does Ballari always have
to bow down to your dominance?

854
01:20:08,823 --> 01:20:11,855
Listen up! Dominance isn't something
handed to you like a gift.

855
01:20:12,573 --> 01:20:14,573
You have to go to war and seize it.

856
01:20:15,740 --> 01:20:17,240
Do you have the guts for that?

857
01:20:18,380 --> 01:20:20,380
Do you have the courage to stand against me?

858
01:20:21,198 --> 01:20:26,865
Not today, you scoundrels, and not ever...
Ballari belongs to Venkatappa Naidu.

859
01:20:27,428 --> 01:20:29,428
I am the King here!

860
01:20:34,782 --> 01:20:40,573
I hacked your father to death, piece by piece,
because he refused to obey me

861
01:20:41,282 --> 01:20:43,990
without even sparing a thought for my own brother.

862
01:20:44,157 --> 01:20:49,698
Try messing with me one more time, and I'll
turn your house into a cremation ground, you.. scoundrel.

863
01:20:50,365 --> 01:20:52,823
You’ll be left sitting there, burying the dead.

864
01:20:54,558 --> 01:20:55,766
Let's go, Vasu!

865
01:21:10,282 --> 01:21:11,782
Is that why you’re insisting on going alone?

866
01:21:12,448 --> 01:21:14,032
We aren't living among ordinary men;

867
01:21:14,448 --> 01:21:16,365
we're living in a world of blood
feuds and vendettas

868
01:21:16,907 --> 01:21:20,198
You shouldn't be going around alone.
You need to take some men with you.

869
01:21:20,782 --> 01:21:23,282
A true leader isn't someone who
charges ahead only to be sacrificed.

870
01:21:23,990 --> 01:21:26,032
He's the one who stays behind
to guide everyone else

871
01:21:26,282 --> 01:21:28,115
and inspires confidence in his people.

872
01:21:28,657 --> 01:21:31,448
If something happens to you, who will lead them?

873
01:21:33,448 --> 01:21:35,989
Your father was just as stubborn.
He went off alone...

874
01:21:35,990 --> 01:21:37,282
and came back a headless corpse.

875
01:21:38,323 --> 01:21:41,573
Your mother grieved herself to death
mourning him.

876
01:21:42,740 --> 01:21:44,282
What if something happens to you?

877
01:22:01,990 --> 01:22:02,823
What's wrong?

878
01:22:05,948 --> 01:22:09,907
I’m just trying to keep my head here
after the humiliation I've faced, dad.

879
01:22:11,657 --> 01:22:14,073
As long as that man is here,
we are powerless.

880
01:22:14,448 --> 01:22:15,865
Let’s just leave.

881
01:22:16,282 --> 01:22:19,740
You can't stop living your life just
because you're angry at the world.

882
01:22:23,333 --> 01:22:26,958
You’re great with the proverbs,
but I have a doubt...

883
01:22:27,490 --> 01:22:29,948
Everyone in our family is dark-skinned,

884
01:22:30,740 --> 01:22:34,448
so how exactly did Vasu Babu
turn out so fair?

885
01:22:35,032 --> 01:22:36,407
His mother was fair-skinned.

886
01:22:39,683 --> 01:22:41,683
Then why didn't you find
yourself a fair-skinned woman too?

887
01:22:44,532 --> 01:22:46,198
Every time I see that Vasu,

888
01:22:46,448 --> 01:22:49,490
I feel a burning
urge to throw acid right in his face.

889
01:22:49,782 --> 01:22:51,657
If you feel that way, imagine my rage!

890
01:22:52,532 --> 01:22:58,865
Do you know how Venkatappa Naidu killed
my father for taking Vasu's father's life?

891
01:23:16,865 --> 01:23:18,323
I saw it with my own eyes...

892
01:23:20,407 --> 01:23:22,407
Venkatappa Naidu isn't just a man...

893
01:23:23,157 --> 01:23:24,323
he is Death personified.

894
01:23:24,865 --> 01:23:26,490
Then when is death finally coming for him?

895
01:23:26,823 --> 01:23:29,490
If we just kill the old man,
we won't be able to handle Vasu Babu.

896
01:23:30,198 --> 01:23:33,115
To that old man, Vasu is his
entire life and his greatest strength.

897
01:23:33,740 --> 01:23:36,323
If we sever that boy's head
and hang it from the Ballari fort...

898
01:23:36,907 --> 01:23:39,448
the sight of it will make him wither
away in agonizing grief until he dies.

899
01:23:39,823 --> 01:23:41,323
The plan is good.

900
01:23:43,073 --> 01:23:44,823
But if even the slightest thing goes wrong...

901
01:23:46,657 --> 01:23:48,907
none of us will make it out of Ballari alive.

902
01:24:19,407 --> 01:24:19,948
Aunty!

903
01:24:21,823 --> 01:24:22,532
Aunty!

904
01:24:26,948 --> 01:24:27,740
Manga!

905
01:24:28,948 --> 01:24:29,739
Manga!

906
01:24:29,740 --> 01:24:30,573
Sister!
- Sister!

907
01:24:33,323 --> 01:24:34,157
Anu!

908
01:24:35,532 --> 01:24:36,907
Hey, cutie!

909
01:24:37,657 --> 01:24:39,073
Manga, how have you been?

910
01:24:40,448 --> 01:24:41,532
I'm great, Uncle!

911
01:24:41,657 --> 01:24:42,657
When did you come here?

912
01:24:43,323 --> 01:24:44,614
I've been waiting for quite a while now.

913
01:24:44,615 --> 01:24:46,906
Sorry, got a bit held up at the temple.

914
01:24:46,907 --> 01:24:48,198
Come on, let's head inside and talk.

915
01:25:04,823 --> 01:25:05,865
Didn't I scare you?

916
01:25:06,657 --> 01:25:09,532
You've seen a lot worse than this.
Why would this scare you?

917
01:25:09,907 --> 01:25:10,698
What are you doing here?

918
01:25:11,032 --> 01:25:13,407
I came to see Grandpa, Vasu Babu.

919
01:25:13,782 --> 01:25:17,739
After taking his blessings,
Samurai made me a cup of coffee.

920
01:25:17,740 --> 01:25:20,698
I was having it when I heard you
were here, so I came over to say hello.

921
01:25:21,198 --> 01:25:22,447
Cut the drama.

922
01:25:22,448 --> 01:25:23,740
Neither of them is home.

923
01:25:25,157 --> 01:25:25,948
Oh! Really?

924
01:25:28,573 --> 01:25:29,907
So, what exactly do you do in Tirupati?

925
01:25:30,407 --> 01:25:31,448
I finished my degree.

926
01:25:31,948 --> 01:25:32,990
Now I'm studying theatre arts.

927
01:25:33,157 --> 01:25:34,198
Theater arts?

928
01:25:34,490 --> 01:25:36,240
You know... acting in stage plays.

929
01:25:36,615 --> 01:25:37,698
So, why did you come here?

930
01:25:38,198 --> 01:25:39,490
Nothing much, Vasu Babu.

931
01:25:39,740 --> 01:25:40,782
Tomorrow's my birthday.

932
01:25:43,448 --> 01:25:44,573
So, what do you want?

933
01:25:45,532 --> 01:25:49,240
Will you spend the day with me tomorrow,
Vasu Babu?

934
01:25:49,823 --> 01:25:51,407
Let's go somewhere together.

935
01:25:53,615 --> 01:25:54,490
Where would we go?

936
01:26:06,615 --> 01:26:09,240
HI, BALLARI!

937
01:26:10,115 --> 01:26:10,782
Is that all?

938
01:26:12,573 --> 01:26:16,157
Aren't you going to hand out clothes
to the poor, feed orphans,

939
01:26:17,073 --> 01:26:20,990
click a couple of selfies, and post
them all over social media?

940
01:26:21,365 --> 01:26:24,240
You underestimate me, Vasu Babu.

941
01:26:24,532 --> 01:26:26,490
I've got a much bigger surprise.

942
01:26:27,198 --> 01:26:27,865
What is it?

943
01:26:28,365 --> 01:26:31,198
Just close your eyes.
You'll find out.

944
01:26:49,698 --> 01:26:50,615
What are you up to?

945
01:26:51,490 --> 01:26:53,490
I told you to keep your eyes closed
and stay still.

946
01:27:00,448 --> 01:27:01,115
What is this?

947
01:27:01,657 --> 01:27:02,448
Are you out of your mind?

948
01:27:02,948 --> 01:27:03,823
Where did you get that gun?

949
01:27:04,448 --> 01:27:05,365
It's my father's.

950
01:27:06,823 --> 01:27:09,323
I swiped it to give you a gift.

951
01:27:12,490 --> 01:27:13,073
Why?

952
01:27:14,657 --> 01:27:15,698
I'm asking you only...

953
01:27:16,698 --> 01:27:20,240
Because...
I'm in love with you, Vasu Babu.

954
01:27:21,740 --> 01:27:22,615
I love you.

955
01:27:24,657 --> 01:27:26,657
I really love you so much.

956
01:27:28,782 --> 01:27:30,073
Don't talk nonsense.

957
01:27:30,657 --> 01:27:32,657
You're here for the festival holidays.
Enjoy your vacation and go back.

958
01:27:33,240 --> 01:27:35,698
Don't come to me with all this love nonsense.

959
01:27:35,907 --> 01:27:36,740
I'm not into all that

960
01:27:40,282 --> 01:27:41,032
Vasu Babu...

961
01:27:42,948 --> 01:27:44,657
Mine isn't just some passing summer fling.

962
01:27:44,990 --> 01:27:47,032
It's a silent love.

963
01:27:47,532 --> 01:27:50,907
I've been in love with you
for ten years.

964
01:27:51,365 --> 01:27:52,323
What are you saying?

965
01:28:07,532 --> 01:28:10,073
Remember when some men
were beating you up...

966
01:28:16,573 --> 01:28:19,490
A bat suddenly came flying through the air...

967
01:28:25,032 --> 01:28:27,032
Did you think God sent it?

968
01:28:28,115 --> 01:28:29,240
It was me.
I threw it.

969
01:28:34,323 --> 01:28:37,948
Every year, the only reason I come to Ballari is for you.

970
01:28:39,865 --> 01:28:43,031
Imagining those 30 days of vacation in Ballari,

971
01:28:43,032 --> 01:28:45,157
I used to spend the rest of the year.

972
01:28:46,990 --> 01:28:48,907
Greetings, Naidu sir.
How are you?

973
01:28:51,698 --> 01:28:52,740
Really, Naidu Garu?

974
01:28:52,907 --> 01:28:55,198
Even on a festival day, you can’t
seem to escape these local disputes?

975
01:28:55,657 --> 01:28:58,782
Once you've stood up for the village,
you can't just sit idle, can you?

976
01:28:58,990 --> 01:29:01,490
You always have a way of silencing
people with your words.

977
01:29:01,532 --> 01:29:04,823
Those who speak up for what's right
need to be firm, just like you.

978
01:29:05,073 --> 01:29:06,115
And just like you!

979
01:29:06,448 --> 01:29:09,073
What’s going on?
There’s no festive vibe here at all.

980
01:29:09,448 --> 01:29:11,907
What are you all even doing?
Come on, let's go!

981
01:29:12,073 --> 01:29:12,907
Come on, let's get ready for the puja.

982
01:29:14,240 --> 01:29:20,157
If every Ugadi is a New Year for everyone else,
for me, it's a new memory written with you.

983
01:29:28,323 --> 01:29:32,907
In these 10 years, there hasn't been a single
day that I haven't thought about you, Vasu Babu.

984
01:29:37,032 --> 01:29:39,073
Hey! Vasu Babu! Come on in.

985
01:29:39,407 --> 01:29:40,532
Grandpa asked me to deliver these documents.

986
01:29:41,282 --> 01:29:43,282
Hey! Hold on!
Where are you going so fast?

987
01:29:43,448 --> 01:29:45,407
It’s rare that you visit...
come, have some tea before you leave.

988
01:29:47,286 --> 01:29:48,370
Come in, Vasu Babu!

989
01:29:53,115 --> 01:29:55,365
I remember every moment I waited for you,

990
01:29:55,782 --> 01:29:59,407
and every effort I made just to cross paths with you.

991
01:30:17,948 --> 01:30:19,448
Look, look, look...

992
01:30:21,698 --> 01:30:22,448
He saw me!

993
01:30:29,698 --> 01:30:33,615
My affection for you grew so much
that I almost forgot myself.

994
01:30:36,073 --> 01:30:38,115
I'm in love with a guy in college, Manga.

995
01:30:38,698 --> 01:30:39,532
Really?

996
01:30:39,740 --> 01:30:42,615
All my friends and I planned a trip together with him.

997
01:30:43,115 --> 01:30:45,115
If I tell my elder brother, he'll definitely say no.

998
01:30:45,698 --> 01:30:47,365
I don't know what to do.

999
01:30:49,365 --> 01:30:53,407
I would look for any small opportunity
just to spend time with you.

1000
01:30:54,782 --> 01:30:55,532
I've got an idea.

1001
01:30:56,490 --> 01:30:57,198
Take care.

1002
01:30:58,365 --> 01:31:00,115
Don't forget to turn off your phone.

1003
01:31:00,198 --> 01:31:00,907
Okay.

1004
01:31:01,323 --> 01:31:01,782
Bye.

1005
01:31:07,240 --> 01:31:09,406
Anitha’s been kidnapped, Uncle!

1006
01:31:09,407 --> 01:31:11,448
Anitha’s been kidnapped! Uncle!

1007
01:31:11,823 --> 01:31:13,865
Anitha’s been kidnapped!

1008
01:31:14,532 --> 01:31:15,615
What did they look like?

1009
01:31:16,240 --> 01:31:19,282
Well... they weren't fair-skinned,
but they weren't dark either...

1010
01:31:19,698 --> 01:31:20,990
they were sort of dusky.

1011
01:31:22,032 --> 01:31:22,740
Vasu Babu sent those guys who got caught with the
diaries to jail recently... maybe one of them did this out of spite.

1012
01:31:22,907 --> 01:31:26,323
Our lawyer fleeces those who get caught
for every penny they have, doesn't he?

1013
01:31:26,573 --> 01:31:29,073
Perhaps one of them held a grudge
and orchestrated this whole thing?

1014
01:31:29,698 --> 01:31:31,407
That reminds me,

1015
01:31:31,948 --> 01:31:36,115
a couple of clients got into a heated
argument with me over fees the other day.

1016
01:31:36,615 --> 01:31:39,364
I have a strong feeling one of them
is behind this kidnapping.

1017
01:31:39,365 --> 01:31:40,532
You should've mentioned that sooner!

1018
01:31:40,698 --> 01:31:41,365
Who are they?

1019
01:31:42,782 --> 01:31:44,407
Jaffer and Pavurala Shiva.

1020
01:31:44,990 --> 01:31:45,948
I know exactly who they are.

1021
01:32:00,073 --> 01:32:01,448
Why do you keep glancing at me?

1022
01:32:02,740 --> 01:32:03,907
No reason, none at all.

1023
01:32:04,823 --> 01:32:05,989
By the way, is your name just 'Manga'?

1024
01:32:05,990 --> 01:32:07,240
Or is there something before or after it?

1025
01:32:07,740 --> 01:32:12,407
It’s Veera Venkata Naga Bhagyalakshmi
Sindhoora Alivelu Manga.

1026
01:32:18,448 --> 01:32:21,657
Look, Jaffer... if you have a beef
with the lawyer, settle it like a man.

1027
01:32:22,073 --> 01:32:24,573
But kidnapping his sister
is just plain wrong, isn't it?

1028
01:32:24,782 --> 01:32:27,115
Me, kidnapping her?
Did you actually see it happen?

1029
01:32:27,365 --> 01:32:29,698
What, have you been listening
in from outside our house?

1030
01:32:29,948 --> 01:32:31,948
You’re just spouting pure filth!

1031
01:32:32,240 --> 01:32:33,365
Mind your tongue.

1032
01:32:36,740 --> 01:32:39,573
I just want a straight answer.
Did you do it or not?

1033
01:32:40,157 --> 01:32:41,282
Cut the nonsense.

1034
01:32:42,615 --> 01:32:43,407
Tell me, Where is she?

1035
01:32:44,198 --> 01:32:47,864
Brother... knowing he's your man, do you think
anyone in all of Ballari would dare lay a hand on him?

1036
01:32:47,865 --> 01:32:49,615
I swear on my mother, brother...
I didn't kidnap her.

1037
01:32:50,365 --> 01:32:51,532
Mind your manners.

1038
01:32:53,365 --> 01:32:54,240
Let's uncle.

1039
01:32:58,115 --> 01:32:58,948
Hey stop.

1040
01:32:59,323 --> 01:33:00,407
Do you know the way to our house?

1041
01:33:00,615 --> 01:33:01,407
Of course, I do.

1042
01:33:01,865 --> 01:33:02,740
Good. Then off you go.

1043
01:33:04,115 --> 01:33:06,490
Hey! Vasu Babu! Vasu Babu!

1044
01:33:07,198 --> 01:33:08,740
What a total psycho sadist!

1045
01:33:17,448 --> 01:33:18,198
Anitha!

1046
01:33:21,073 --> 01:33:21,907
Where did you go?

1047
01:33:22,865 --> 01:33:23,948
Who was kidnapped?

1048
01:33:25,032 --> 01:33:26,240
- Why are you so quiet?
- Anitha...!

1049
01:33:28,365 --> 01:33:29,490
Thank you, Vasu Babu.

1050
01:33:29,930 --> 01:33:31,656
Come on, let's go.

1051
01:33:31,657 --> 01:33:33,073
Hm... let's get started.

1052
01:33:33,823 --> 01:33:36,240
Where did you eventually find Anitha, Vasu Babu?

1053
01:33:36,573 --> 01:33:38,948
She was passed out at a Hampi resort,
completely hammered with her friends.

1054
01:33:39,282 --> 01:33:39,990
Drunk?!

1055
01:33:40,948 --> 01:33:42,157
You little brat!

1056
01:33:57,240 --> 01:34:00,490
Every time I came here,
I wanted to tell you.

1057
01:34:00,907 --> 01:34:03,490
More than the fear of your rejection,

1058
01:34:04,157 --> 01:34:07,323
I find solace in suffering silently within myself.

1059
01:34:09,740 --> 01:34:12,282
I'd leave with my heart full of memories,

1060
01:34:13,198 --> 01:34:17,032
then spend the whole year
waiting to see you again.

1061
01:34:19,198 --> 01:34:21,448
If I can't tell you today,

1062
01:34:22,073 --> 01:34:24,240
I never will, Vasu Babu.

1063
01:34:26,240 --> 01:34:30,657
This madness I have for you
didn't begin today, Vasu Babu.

1064
01:34:40,323 --> 01:34:41,615
When a girl loves someone...

1065
01:34:42,198 --> 01:34:43,532
can she truly love this much?

1066
01:34:47,722 --> 01:35:04,180
"'This heart knows no darkness."

1067
01:35:05,305 --> 01:35:24,180
"Without your companionship,
I can't even breathe."

1068
01:35:41,430 --> 01:35:48,180
"The dreams are exciting,"

1069
01:35:57,722 --> 01:36:04,638
"Our hearts are coming together."

1070
01:36:07,722 --> 01:36:14,722
"Turn me into the air that you breathe"

1071
01:36:15,263 --> 01:36:21,971
"I will walk till the end of time,
Come with me."

1072
01:36:21,972 --> 01:36:25,762
"My heart will remain unhurt
even if an atom bomb strikes me,"

1073
01:36:25,763 --> 01:36:29,387
"I was a man like a gun’s bullet,
You turned me into a man as sweet as honey."

1074
01:36:29,388 --> 01:36:33,762
"I am dying and coming alive,
Putting my soul behind every step,"

1075
01:36:33,763 --> 01:36:37,722
"My life and death are only with you."

1076
01:36:45,722 --> 01:36:54,722
"Our hearts are coming together."

1077
01:37:41,722 --> 01:37:45,512
"The pleasantness in a stone,"

1078
01:37:45,513 --> 01:37:49,429
"The colors of the night,"

1079
01:37:49,430 --> 01:37:56,596
"All get their liveliness from your love."

1080
01:37:56,597 --> 01:38:03,971
"You transformed a stone.
You lightened this darkness,"

1081
01:38:03,972 --> 01:38:11,138
"You filled your love in me."

1082
01:38:27,555 --> 01:38:33,222
"The dreams are exciting,"

1083
01:39:04,888 --> 01:39:08,512
"Tears fill my eyes."

1084
01:39:08,513 --> 01:39:12,262
"Sleep doesn’t come,"

1085
01:39:12,263 --> 01:39:19,221
"When I am not beside you."

1086
01:39:19,222 --> 01:39:23,721
"I will burn the water,"

1087
01:39:23,722 --> 01:39:26,721
"I will kill the sleep,"

1088
01:39:26,722 --> 01:39:35,347
"The moment I leave you,
Will be the moment my breath will stop."

1089
01:39:50,763 --> 01:39:57,513
"The dreams are exciting,"

1090
01:40:07,055 --> 01:40:13,972
"Our hearts are coming together."

1091
01:40:17,305 --> 01:40:17,972
Hey!

1092
01:40:18,430 --> 01:40:20,430
Hey, who's that girl hanging
around with Vasu Babu?

1093
01:40:21,513 --> 01:40:22,180
I don't know, brother.

1094
01:40:23,460 --> 01:40:24,252
Find out.

1095
01:40:24,752 --> 01:40:25,794
Okay Brother.
- Let's go.

1096
01:40:30,252 --> 01:40:32,377
Hello?
- Am I speaking to Peddi Reddy?

1097
01:40:32,544 --> 01:40:33,752
Yes. Who is this?

1098
01:40:33,960 --> 01:40:35,334
Leave about me.

1099
01:40:35,335 --> 01:40:37,044
But your daughter is in Ballari right now, isn’t she?

1100
01:40:39,377 --> 01:40:39,960
Yes.

1101
01:40:40,335 --> 01:40:42,960
How can you just leave your
daughter on her own like that?

1102
01:40:43,085 --> 01:40:46,002
Shouldn't you know who she's hanging
around with and what she's up to?

1103
01:40:46,585 --> 01:40:48,544
Hey! Who the hell are you?

1104
01:40:48,794 --> 01:40:53,002
I'm telling you to keep an eye on your daughter,
and you're asking who I am?

1105
01:40:53,377 --> 01:40:56,460
Get hold of your daughter
before she slips out of your hands.

1106
01:40:56,835 --> 01:40:57,460
Got it?

1107
01:40:59,127 --> 01:40:59,544
Hello?

1108
01:41:00,044 --> 01:41:00,419
Hello!

1109
01:41:11,919 --> 01:41:13,168
Hello? Yes, brother?

1110
01:41:13,169 --> 01:41:14,252
Put Manga on the phone.

1111
01:41:14,460 --> 01:41:16,252
I think Manga has gone out.

1112
01:41:16,460 --> 01:41:17,669
Gone where?

1113
01:41:18,169 --> 01:41:18,960
What’s wrong, brother?

1114
01:41:19,419 --> 01:41:22,169
I trusted you because you're her
aunt and sent her to stay with you.

1115
01:41:22,544 --> 01:41:28,127
Have you become so blind that you don't even
know what she's doing or who she's with?

1116
01:41:28,252 --> 01:41:28,710
Brother!

1117
01:41:28,877 --> 01:41:37,419
Am I so helpless that I have to hear from some anonymous
caller that my daughter is going around with a man in Ballari?

1118
01:41:37,752 --> 01:41:39,210
I’ll talk to her, brother.

1119
01:41:39,752 --> 01:41:41,377
No more talking!

1120
01:41:42,460 --> 01:41:45,877
Send that girl back to Tirupati immediately.
Right this second!

1121
01:41:46,627 --> 01:41:49,335
You know what'll happen
if I have to come there, don't you?

1122
01:41:52,669 --> 01:41:54,044
Why is Aunt calling me now?

1123
01:41:58,127 --> 01:41:59,377
Just a moment, Vasu Babu.

1124
01:42:01,335 --> 01:42:02,002
Manga!

1125
01:42:02,585 --> 01:42:03,210
Aunt?

1126
01:42:03,877 --> 01:42:04,585
Where are you?

1127
01:42:05,085 --> 01:42:06,335
I'm at the temple, Aunt.

1128
01:42:06,419 --> 01:42:07,377
Cut the drama!

1129
01:42:07,710 --> 01:42:12,002
If your father found out about this all the way from
Tirupati, I can only imagine how far you've gone.

1130
01:42:15,127 --> 01:42:15,919
What happened?

1131
01:42:18,919 --> 01:42:20,377
What do you mean Dad found out?

1132
01:42:20,502 --> 01:42:21,502
Shut your mouth!

1133
01:42:21,877 --> 01:42:23,752
He wants you to leave for Tirupati immediately.

1134
01:42:23,877 --> 01:42:25,585
Otherwise, he'll come to Ballari himself.

1135
01:42:25,669 --> 01:42:27,585
Wherever you are,
come home first.

1136
01:42:28,335 --> 01:42:29,169
What happened?

1137
01:42:31,377 --> 01:42:32,585
Why are you so worried?

1138
01:42:32,794 --> 01:42:35,544
My father found out about us.

1139
01:42:35,835 --> 01:42:37,960
I always knew the fuse would blow
at the lawyer's house someday.

1140
01:42:38,294 --> 01:42:40,169
But I never expected the whole
transformer to blow in Tirupati!

1141
01:42:42,585 --> 01:42:43,502
What happened, Manga?

1142
01:42:45,752 --> 01:42:47,169
I'm scared, Vasu Babu.

1143
01:42:48,002 --> 01:42:49,502
You don't know my father.

1144
01:42:50,627 --> 01:42:52,169
And I don't need to.

1145
01:42:52,669 --> 01:42:54,669
I can't live without you,
Vasu Babu.

1146
01:42:55,169 --> 01:42:59,252
I’m scared that if I leave now,
we might never see each other again.

1147
01:42:59,294 --> 01:43:00,127
Why are you afraid?

1148
01:43:00,794 --> 01:43:03,919
I don't know... I have a bad feeling, Vasu Babu.

1149
01:43:07,919 --> 01:43:10,294
Vasu Babu! Where are you going?

1150
01:43:10,419 --> 01:43:11,169
Vasu Babu!

1151
01:43:17,044 --> 01:43:18,002
What are you doing?

1152
01:43:30,460 --> 01:43:31,710
What is this, Vasu Babu?

1153
01:43:32,044 --> 01:43:33,669
Are we married now?

1154
01:43:33,919 --> 01:43:34,585
Yes.

1155
01:43:35,210 --> 01:43:36,752
Yes... from this very moment,
you are Vasu’s wife.

1156
01:43:37,210 --> 01:43:39,835
Not just today...
No one will ever separate us.

1157
01:43:40,169 --> 01:43:41,794
I’m leaving for Tirupati today.

1158
01:43:42,002 --> 01:43:45,252
I’ll try to talk to my father
and convince him to accept us.

1159
01:43:45,919 --> 01:43:49,502
If anything happens,
you won't leave me, will you, Vasu Babu?

1160
01:43:50,669 --> 01:43:51,502
Give me your word.

1161
01:43:52,835 --> 01:43:55,960
If it comes down to it, I will stand
against all of Tirupati for you,

1162
01:43:56,627 --> 01:43:58,210
but I will never, ever let you go, Manga.

1163
01:43:58,794 --> 01:43:59,794
I swear.

1164
01:46:27,044 --> 01:46:29,127
Come on! Show me what you're made of!

1165
01:46:58,169 --> 01:46:59,085
Vasu...

1166
01:47:32,710 --> 01:47:35,044
Hey! All of you...
GET THE HELL OUT!

1167
01:48:01,252 --> 01:48:03,627
Vasu Babu...

1168
01:49:30,794 --> 01:49:33,960
Ma'am, you can't stay here.
Please wait over there.

1169
01:50:06,502 --> 01:50:09,127
Lakshmipathi’s men are right here in Ballari, brother.

1170
01:50:11,169 --> 01:50:14,960
[Kannada]
I want him.

1171
01:50:19,877 --> 01:50:22,877
There’s no threat to her life;
she's out of danger.

1172
01:50:24,252 --> 01:50:28,419
She suffered a catastrophic head injury,
resulting in a traumatic brain injury.

1173
01:50:30,877 --> 01:50:35,460
As you can see here, the nerves
in the brain are severely ruptured.

1174
01:50:35,794 --> 01:50:42,627
This has caused damage to the temporal lobes,
resulting in retrograde amnesia.

1175
01:50:44,002 --> 01:50:48,169
To put it simply, due to the severe impact on her head,

1176
01:50:48,919 --> 01:50:51,794
about 30% of the nerves leading
to the brain have been crushed.

1177
01:50:53,877 --> 01:50:56,960
There were numerous blood clots,
most of which we’ve cleared.

1178
01:50:57,669 --> 01:51:00,127
However, we couldn't insert a stent.

1179
01:51:00,752 --> 01:51:03,752
Attempting to touch these
nerves would be life-threatening.

1180
01:51:06,085 --> 01:51:10,585
Will she ever remember anything,
even after some time has passed, Doctor?

1181
01:51:10,960 --> 01:51:15,169
Nothing that has happened in her
life up until now will ever come back to her.

1182
01:51:25,877 --> 01:51:26,585
Brother!

1183
01:51:30,752 --> 01:51:34,210
They... they got married, brother.

1184
01:51:35,752 --> 01:51:38,669
But that boy's family is very decent...

1185
01:51:41,877 --> 01:51:48,460
How do you even have the nerve to defend
the man who brought my daughter to death's door?

1186
01:51:49,335 --> 01:51:55,002
I don't care who he is
or what kind of family he comes from.

1187
01:51:56,169 --> 01:52:01,794
For better or worse...
my daughter has forgotten her entire past.

1188
01:52:02,335 --> 01:52:05,377
I believe that's Lord Venkateswara's blessing.

1189
01:52:06,794 --> 01:52:08,794
I’m taking Manga back to Tirupati with me.

1190
01:52:09,460 --> 01:52:11,585
I’ll raise her all over again, just like a little child.

1191
01:52:11,710 --> 01:52:14,669
If you have any shred of respect for me,

1192
01:52:14,710 --> 01:52:22,335
Swear you'll never tell Manga
or anyone in my family about her love.

1193
01:52:22,502 --> 01:52:23,669
Swear it!

1194
01:52:25,169 --> 01:52:28,294
I won't tell anyone, brother.
Never.

1195
01:52:34,585 --> 01:52:36,502
Please understand what I'm saying, Vasu Babu.

1196
01:52:37,419 --> 01:52:38,752
Manga doesn't remember anything.

1197
01:52:39,794 --> 01:52:40,794
She doesn't recognize anyone...

1198
01:52:43,085 --> 01:52:43,835
not even you.

1199
01:52:44,710 --> 01:52:46,752
My brother has taken Manga to Tirupati.

1200
01:52:47,002 --> 01:52:48,169
Let Manga go.

1201
01:52:49,210 --> 01:52:50,794
The two of you are not meant to be.

1202
01:52:52,669 --> 01:52:55,085
If something happens
between you two and things go wrong,

1203
01:52:55,669 --> 01:52:57,210
I don't have the strength to bear it.

1204
01:53:00,335 --> 01:53:02,002
At least you still have memories of her...

1205
01:53:02,835 --> 01:53:04,169
she doesn't even have those.

1206
01:53:06,085 --> 01:53:08,002
It’s best to leave all of this behind.

1207
01:53:54,460 --> 01:53:59,919
"Come back, come back here,
my dear come back,"

1208
01:54:00,127 --> 01:54:06,002
"My soul has left me and is moving towards you."

1209
01:54:06,460 --> 01:54:11,959
"Come back, come back here,
my dear come back,"

1210
01:54:11,960 --> 01:54:18,085
"I am confined in the prison of loneliness."

1211
01:54:18,460 --> 01:54:21,251
"Even if the time is against me,"

1212
01:54:21,252 --> 01:54:24,044
"no matter which injury is hurting me,"

1213
01:54:24,460 --> 01:54:26,959
"I am waiting for you,"

1214
01:54:26,960 --> 01:54:29,960
"even though you will never come back."

1215
01:54:30,460 --> 01:54:35,710
"If you are not here, my existence doesn’t matter,"

1216
01:54:36,085 --> 01:54:41,877
"I am carrying the burden of sadness inside me."

1217
01:54:42,210 --> 01:54:48,002
'I see you as the form of love,"

1218
01:54:48,210 --> 01:54:54,335
"but you did not show mercy on me,
as you forgot me like a curse."

1219
01:54:54,669 --> 01:54:57,544
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1220
01:54:57,627 --> 01:55:00,419
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1221
01:55:00,460 --> 01:55:03,377
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1222
01:55:03,460 --> 01:55:06,502
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1223
01:55:06,794 --> 01:55:09,544
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1224
01:55:09,669 --> 01:55:12,669
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1225
01:55:12,752 --> 01:55:15,627
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1226
01:55:15,752 --> 01:55:18,544
"Come back, my dear.
Come back to me, my dear."

1227
01:55:21,627 --> 01:55:22,669
Vasu Babu, go ahead and do it.

1228
01:55:23,252 --> 01:55:24,585
Vasu Babu, go ahead.
Kill him.

1229
01:55:33,919 --> 01:55:35,169
This is my sister,

1230
01:55:35,752 --> 01:55:36,544
Varalakshmi.

1231
01:55:37,169 --> 01:55:38,252
She is your aunt.

1232
01:55:39,252 --> 01:55:40,460
She has come here from Ballary.

1233
01:55:51,919 --> 01:55:57,085
"You promised to never leave me,
but now I can’t see you anywhere,"

1234
01:55:57,960 --> 01:56:03,335
"I am in darkness, come back like the moon."

1235
01:56:03,752 --> 01:56:09,294
"I can’t see you, I can’t hear your words,"

1236
01:56:09,669 --> 01:56:15,085
'I live like a dead man,
come back and make me alive."

1237
01:56:15,252 --> 01:56:20,252
"You are now my tears,"

1238
01:56:21,085 --> 01:56:26,585
'Don’t leave my eyes."

1239
01:56:27,377 --> 01:56:32,459
"Come back, come back here,
my dear come back,"

1240
01:56:32,460 --> 01:56:38,959
"My soul has left me and is moving towards you."

1241
01:56:38,960 --> 01:56:44,959
"Come back, come back here,
my dear come back,"

1242
01:56:44,960 --> 01:56:50,960
"I am a prisoner in the prison of loneliness."

1243
01:56:51,669 --> 01:56:56,752
"Even if the time is against me,
no matter which injury is hurting me,"

1244
01:56:57,585 --> 01:57:02,460
'I am waiting for you,
even though you will never come back."

1245
01:57:02,960 --> 01:57:08,627
'If you are not here, then I don’t exist,"

1246
01:57:09,127 --> 01:57:14,460
"I am carrying the burden of sadness inside me."

1247
01:57:15,210 --> 01:57:20,710
''I see you as the form of love,""

1248
01:57:21,085 --> 01:57:27,085
"but you did not show mercy on me,
as you forgot me like a curse."

1249
01:57:27,544 --> 01:57:30,419
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1250
01:57:30,502 --> 01:57:33,294
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1251
01:57:33,335 --> 01:57:36,252
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1252
01:57:36,335 --> 01:57:39,377
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1253
01:57:39,669 --> 01:57:42,419
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1254
01:57:42,544 --> 01:57:45,544
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1255
01:57:45,627 --> 01:57:48,502
"Comeback my dear,
comeback my dear,"

1256
01:57:48,627 --> 01:57:51,419
"Come back, my dear.
Come back to me, my dear."

1257
01:57:54,919 --> 01:57:55,627
What's this?

1258
01:57:57,877 --> 01:57:58,877
Are you crying?

1259
01:57:59,669 --> 01:58:01,169
Go ahead and cry!

1260
01:58:01,877 --> 01:58:04,919
My own son and daughter-in-law are turning
to ashes on a funeral pyre right before my eyes,

1261
01:58:05,335 --> 01:58:06,919
yet I have a heart of stone that doesn't shed a single tear.

1262
01:58:07,627 --> 01:58:09,960
You are putting me through a hell
that even your late father never did.

1263
01:58:10,002 --> 01:58:10,585
Sir... please, Sir...

1264
01:58:13,710 --> 01:58:15,210
My presence is only for
those who live by instilling fear,

1265
01:58:15,710 --> 01:58:17,960
not for someone who sits around weeping.

1266
01:58:18,294 --> 01:58:18,835
Get out!

1267
01:58:19,419 --> 01:58:21,044
Go to Bangalore and manage the factory.

1268
01:58:21,919 --> 01:58:22,335
Yes, sir...

1269
01:58:22,627 --> 01:58:24,710
Put him on the train to Bangalore immediately.

1270
01:58:31,669 --> 01:58:34,085
Uncle, you shouldn't have taken
me to the railway station,

1271
01:58:36,169 --> 01:58:37,210
but to the bus stand.

1272
01:58:40,460 --> 01:58:41,377
What is it, Vasu Babu?

1273
01:58:42,419 --> 01:58:43,669
I am not going to Bangalore.

1274
01:58:45,294 --> 01:58:46,044
I'm going to Tirupati.

1275
01:59:10,377 --> 01:59:11,794
Let Manga go.

1276
01:59:12,669 --> 01:59:14,335
The two of you are not meant to be.

1277
01:59:15,377 --> 01:59:16,544
Manga will always be mine!

1278
01:59:20,460 --> 01:59:22,169
I came to Tirupati only for Manga!

1279
01:59:22,960 --> 01:59:23,710
Who are you?

1280
01:59:24,252 --> 01:59:25,085
My friend?

1281
01:59:25,419 --> 01:59:26,335
My teacher?

1282
01:59:26,544 --> 01:59:28,044
Or are you a member of my family?

1283
01:59:34,669 --> 01:59:37,460
Have you ever been in love before?
– I don't know.

1284
01:59:45,127 --> 01:59:46,377
Manga is mine

1285
01:59:47,085 --> 01:59:49,294
I will be the one to marry her eventually.

1286
01:59:51,085 --> 01:59:52,002
I love you.

1287
02:00:04,960 --> 02:00:07,419
Manga, my love is not a decision
made in a moment of impulse.

1288
02:00:07,835 --> 02:00:11,169
But you brought me here
with a hidden motive in your mind.

1289
02:00:11,585 --> 02:00:13,377
Seeing you like this terrifies me, Seenu.

1290
02:00:13,710 --> 02:00:15,168
Don't ever show your face to me again.

1291
02:00:15,169 --> 02:00:16,169
Never...

1292
02:00:28,710 --> 02:00:29,502
Swatantra Babu!

1293
02:00:30,502 --> 02:00:31,294
Swatantra Babu!

1294
02:00:32,002 --> 02:00:33,960
I don't know anything... Balu did it all.

1295
02:00:34,127 --> 02:00:37,085
He kept Sreenu in his house
even though I told him not to.

1296
02:00:41,252 --> 02:00:41,960
Was all of this just a dream?

1297
02:00:42,252 --> 02:00:42,919
No

1298
02:00:43,502 --> 02:00:44,669
it's your true nature.

1299
02:00:45,294 --> 02:00:48,627
I brought a useless fellows like you into my house...
I should beat myself with a slipper for doing that.

1300
02:00:49,002 --> 02:00:51,419
Who could be bigger loafers
than the two of us in Tirupati?

1301
02:00:51,794 --> 02:00:53,044
Trust me... Balu.
- You...

1302
02:00:54,960 --> 02:00:55,752
Who are they?

1303
02:00:56,127 --> 02:00:57,502
Peddireddy's men.

1304
02:00:58,877 --> 02:01:00,044
Did they arrive already?

1305
02:01:00,544 --> 02:01:01,919
This is my last day in Tirupati.

1306
02:01:02,252 --> 02:01:03,669
You...

1307
02:01:04,335 --> 02:01:05,210
Who is Balu here?

1308
02:01:05,627 --> 02:01:07,043
Hey Balu, go, they are calling you.

1309
02:01:07,044 --> 02:01:08,459
Me? Balu? What do you mean?
You're Balu, aren't you?

1310
02:01:08,460 --> 02:01:09,044
He's the one.

1311
02:01:10,877 --> 02:01:11,877
I thought you said Babu.

1312
02:01:12,710 --> 02:01:13,294
Tell me, what do you want?

1313
02:01:13,419 --> 02:01:14,835
Is a guy named Seenu staying with you?

1314
02:01:15,294 --> 02:01:16,127
Seenu?

1315
02:01:16,877 --> 02:01:17,627
Who is Seenu?

1316
02:01:18,502 --> 02:01:19,877
I am Seenu. Tell me.

1317
02:01:21,294 --> 02:01:22,169
Hey Seenu!

1318
02:01:22,294 --> 02:01:23,919
When did you arrive?
You didn't even let me know!

1319
02:01:24,002 --> 02:01:24,710
How have you been?

1320
02:01:24,960 --> 02:01:26,044
Save your pleasantries for later.

1321
02:01:26,460 --> 02:01:28,669
Peddireddy has ordered
for all of you to be brought to him.

1322
02:01:35,544 --> 02:01:36,294
Hello sir.

1323
02:01:37,710 --> 02:01:38,835
So, you’re Seenu?

1324
02:01:39,044 --> 02:01:39,419
Yes.

1325
02:01:39,835 --> 02:01:42,419
You didn’t just save my brother’s life;

1326
02:01:42,710 --> 02:01:45,085
you saved my strength and
my honor in front of my enemies.

1327
02:01:45,585 --> 02:01:46,377
Who are they?

1328
02:01:47,127 --> 02:01:48,544
This is my uncle, Balu.

1329
02:01:48,794 --> 02:01:50,544
I’m currently staying with him.

1330
02:01:51,377 --> 02:01:52,377
What do you do for a living?

1331
02:01:52,877 --> 02:01:55,419
I organize small wedding events, sir.

1332
02:01:55,752 --> 02:01:57,294
But I've given that up now.

1333
02:01:57,585 --> 02:01:59,252
Since I couldn't find any work in Tirupati,

1334
02:01:59,460 --> 02:02:02,043
I had decided to pack up and leave town today.

1335
02:02:02,044 --> 02:02:03,959
If you can find him some work, he'll do it.

1336
02:02:03,960 --> 02:02:05,169
Don't you have any work in Tirupati?

1337
02:02:06,210 --> 02:02:06,960
Hey, Subba Reddy!

1338
02:02:07,294 --> 02:02:07,669
Yes, Brother

1339
02:02:08,002 --> 02:02:09,794
Who did we give our daughter’s wedding contract to?

1340
02:02:09,960 --> 02:02:11,669
Palamaner Bujji is handling it.

1341
02:02:12,294 --> 02:02:13,918
Cancel it.
- Okay brother.

1342
02:02:13,919 --> 02:02:15,294
Give the entire contract to these guys.

1343
02:02:15,585 --> 02:02:16,294
Okay Brother

1344
02:02:16,877 --> 02:02:17,627
We're done for.

1345
02:02:17,835 --> 02:02:19,669
Come over tomorrow and
take charge of the wedding preparations.

1346
02:02:19,835 --> 02:02:22,460
Once the wedding is done,
I’ll set you up with a solid business contract.

1347
02:02:22,752 --> 02:02:23,752
Thank you sir.

1348
02:02:24,169 --> 02:02:24,794
Namaste sir.

1349
02:02:24,960 --> 02:02:26,793
You got this contract because of me.
Now you owe me a party.

1350
02:02:26,794 --> 02:02:27,544
Seenu...

1351
02:02:32,002 --> 02:02:34,210
If my brother finds out that you're
the one messing with Manga...

1352
02:02:35,085 --> 02:02:36,710
he will kill you right here.

1353
02:02:38,044 --> 02:02:43,002
I kept my mouth shut and saved
you for the sole reason that you saved my life.

1354
02:02:43,419 --> 02:02:46,585
From now on, drop the act and just do your job carefully.

1355
02:02:51,294 --> 02:02:53,376
I got you this job...
- A job? You got me into trouble!

1356
02:02:53,377 --> 02:02:55,794
Even if I did, can't you at least buy me a quarter?
You're making such a fuss.

1357
02:03:29,419 --> 02:03:31,544
When my grandson was hovering
between life and death,

1358
02:03:32,502 --> 02:03:35,294
they took that girl away from Ballary
and left him behind.

1359
02:03:36,919 --> 02:03:39,169
did I ever say a single word to you?

1360
02:03:41,669 --> 02:03:43,085
If you had a son,

1361
02:03:43,169 --> 02:03:46,585
and he was wandering around
like a madman in some strange town for a girl...

1362
02:03:47,210 --> 02:03:49,044
could you just stand by and watch?

1363
02:03:49,252 --> 02:03:52,085
I tried telling him to leave Tirupati, too.

1364
02:03:54,544 --> 02:03:55,085
Grandpa...

1365
02:03:58,794 --> 02:04:01,377
How dare you lie to me?!

1366
02:04:02,585 --> 02:04:05,709
You told me you were going to Bangalore,
but you came to Tirupati instead.

1367
02:04:05,710 --> 02:04:06,794
Did you think I wouldn't find out?

1368
02:04:08,877 --> 02:04:10,169
How did I raise you?

1369
02:04:10,877 --> 02:04:15,044
I taught you to stand by those who trust you,
to fight back if provoked, to hack, to kill...

1370
02:04:15,419 --> 02:04:16,835
That’s what I taught you!

1371
02:04:17,169 --> 02:04:18,960
Where did this "love" suddenly come from?

1372
02:04:25,044 --> 02:04:26,335
Manga taught me.

1373
02:04:43,335 --> 02:04:45,460
She once told me she couldn't live without me

1374
02:04:46,294 --> 02:04:48,294
Now... she’s lost her memory, and it's all because of me.

1375
02:04:49,877 --> 02:04:51,835
Now, I’m the one who can't live without her.

1376
02:04:53,710 --> 02:04:57,252
Then just go tell the girl the truth! Tell her
that you two loved each other, and bring her home.

1377
02:04:58,169 --> 02:05:00,085
I'd like to see who dares to stop you.

1378
02:05:00,377 --> 02:05:02,044
The problem isn't about
someone stopping me, Grandpa.

1379
02:05:02,585 --> 02:05:04,210
The problem is... my Manga isn't willing to come with me.

1380
02:05:05,960 --> 02:05:08,959
It wouldn't take much to just go to her, tell her
that we loved each other, spent time together,

1381
02:05:08,960 --> 02:05:11,502
and got married, and drag her back.

1382
02:05:13,627 --> 02:05:16,919
But if I do that... it would be
like forcefully carrying away a clueless child.

1383
02:05:18,002 --> 02:05:18,960
I won't do that.

1384
02:05:24,460 --> 02:05:25,876
I came here for one reason...

1385
02:05:25,877 --> 02:05:30,044
To give Manga the exact same love she once gave me,

1386
02:05:30,377 --> 02:05:32,127
and to win her heart all over again.

1387
02:05:33,335 --> 02:05:35,252
How much longer are you going to wait like this?

1388
02:05:35,585 --> 02:05:37,335
Manga is getting married in four days, Grandpa.

1389
02:05:38,335 --> 02:05:39,752
Just give me these four days.

1390
02:05:40,669 --> 02:05:42,960
If my faith is true, I will come home with Manga.

1391
02:05:44,085 --> 02:05:47,710
But if your doubts are true...
I will pack up and return to Ballary with you.

1392
02:05:48,335 --> 02:05:49,294
Four days

1393
02:05:50,877 --> 02:05:56,127
I don't care how you make that girl fall
for you, or how you bring her back.

1394
02:05:56,460 --> 02:05:59,169
But listen to me carefully...
if anyone so much as lays a hand on you

1395
02:05:59,419 --> 02:06:01,585
the people of Tirupati won't be
talking about your love story.

1396
02:06:02,210 --> 02:06:07,335
They'll be talking about the bloodbath
unleashed by Venkatrappa Naidu.

1397
02:06:23,710 --> 02:06:27,335
Why don't you walk on the Tirumala pathway
instead? At least it'll lead you to God.

1398
02:06:28,335 --> 02:06:29,460
I told you, didn't I?

1399
02:06:30,210 --> 02:06:32,127
Venkatappa Naidu has come down to Tirupati.

1400
02:06:33,335 --> 02:06:37,669
He must have figured out by now
that we're the ones behind the attack on Vasu Babu.

1401
02:06:38,335 --> 02:06:39,127
No, boss.

1402
02:06:39,627 --> 02:06:41,752
Something else is going down
here, right under our noses.

1403
02:06:43,835 --> 02:06:45,252
Yeah, you guys just keep sitting around overthinking this!

1404
02:06:45,585 --> 02:06:46,669
The second his daughter’s wedding is over,

1405
02:06:46,877 --> 02:06:50,544
Peddireddy is going to assume I ordered the
hit on his brother and come straight for my throat!

1406
02:06:50,960 --> 02:06:51,960
Before the wedding wraps up...

1407
02:06:52,835 --> 02:06:53,877
we’ll eliminate Vasu Babu.

1408
02:06:54,960 --> 02:06:56,044
Just hold your nerve until then.

1409
02:06:57,294 --> 02:07:01,669
After that, I’ll take out Peddireddy
and hand the entire city of Tirupati over to you.

1410
02:07:02,169 --> 02:07:03,085
You gave your word, brother.

1411
02:07:03,419 --> 02:07:04,002
That's all I need.

1412
02:07:08,377 --> 02:07:11,043
When are you coming?
There are only three days left.

1413
02:07:11,044 --> 02:07:12,084
Leave as soon as you can.

1414
02:07:12,085 --> 02:07:12,919
Manga...

1415
02:07:13,794 --> 02:07:14,794
Manga...

1416
02:07:16,669 --> 02:07:17,752
Your mother is calling you.

1417
02:07:23,127 --> 02:07:25,169
I told you never to show your
face to me again, didn't I?

1418
02:07:25,585 --> 02:07:26,419
What are you doing here?

1419
02:07:28,127 --> 02:07:30,585
I came with the hope that at any given moment,
you might finally understand me, Manga.

1420
02:07:31,294 --> 02:07:33,127
Don't you understand when I say it once?

1421
02:07:34,044 --> 02:07:34,877
Forget about me.

1422
02:07:36,085 --> 02:07:38,044
You will find a much better girl than me.

1423
02:07:38,419 --> 02:07:39,794
Are you cursing me, Manga?

1424
02:07:40,752 --> 02:07:42,794
How else can I make you understand, Seenu?

1425
02:07:42,919 --> 02:07:44,210
I'm asking you the exact same thing, Manga.

1426
02:07:44,544 --> 02:07:46,419
What do I have to do to
make you understand my love?

1427
02:07:48,044 --> 02:07:49,377
I can't hide what I feel.

1428
02:07:51,335 --> 02:07:53,294
I don't know how to show
my love in small, measured pieces.

1429
02:07:54,294 --> 02:07:57,169
I have taken every ounce of
love I have for you and laid it all right at your feet.

1430
02:08:00,294 --> 02:08:04,377
I don't know how to love you any more than this...
I don't know how else to prove my love to you.

1431
02:08:07,044 --> 02:08:08,794
As deeply and greatly as you love me...

1432
02:08:09,294 --> 02:08:11,502
that same love just isn't blooming
in my heart for you, Seenu.

1433
02:08:11,710 --> 02:08:12,502
Damn this heart...

1434
02:08:13,502 --> 02:08:15,335
It doesn't seem to understand that a heart
is just a muscle that beats lub-dub, lub-dub.

1435
02:08:16,710 --> 02:08:19,127
Love isn't born here, Manga.. It’s born here!

1436
02:08:22,044 --> 02:08:23,502
Because my love for you is rooted here

1437
02:08:24,210 --> 02:08:26,002
my heartbeat races here when I look at you.

1438
02:08:26,960 --> 02:08:28,377
Because I am crazy about you here

1439
02:08:28,794 --> 02:08:30,544
my heart aches when you aren't around.

1440
02:08:31,752 --> 02:08:33,377
Because you are my very life here,

1441
02:08:34,044 --> 02:08:36,169
it feels like my soul is being ripped out
when you distance yourself.

1442
02:08:39,335 --> 02:08:40,669
That is exactly why, even if a person's heart stops beating,

1443
02:08:40,794 --> 02:08:43,960
their mind stays alive for a few more seconds—
because it simply cannot let go of the memories.

1444
02:08:45,835 --> 02:08:47,544
Just give me this much space in your mind, Manga.

1445
02:08:48,127 --> 02:08:49,210
Just a tiny space... that's enough.

1446
02:08:52,460 --> 02:08:53,044
Manga...

1447
02:08:55,752 --> 02:08:57,585
My wedding is in four days...

1448
02:08:58,002 --> 02:09:00,085
and if I am standing here crying like this...

1449
02:09:02,669 --> 02:09:03,960
you are the reason, Seenu.

1450
02:09:05,919 --> 02:09:07,877
Every single time you cross my path...

1451
02:09:08,294 --> 02:09:10,585
I-I get so overwhelmed with anxiety.

1452
02:09:13,169 --> 02:09:14,002
But...

1453
02:09:14,627 --> 02:09:17,835
I don't hate you enough to want to hurt you,

1454
02:09:18,252 --> 02:09:22,085
nor do I like you enough to love you, Seenu.

1455
02:09:25,627 --> 02:09:28,127
If my family sees you here like
this, they will kill you.

1456
02:09:28,460 --> 02:09:29,585
Please, just leave. Go away from here!

1457
02:09:29,669 --> 02:09:30,669
I am not going anywhere!

1458
02:09:31,794 --> 02:09:34,419
Until the very last second before
the wedding knot is tied around your neck...

1459
02:09:35,544 --> 02:09:38,377
I will stay right here. With the unshakeable
faith that your love for me will wake up again...

1460
02:09:40,669 --> 02:09:41,752
I will keep waiting.

1461
02:09:48,585 --> 02:09:53,044
"Don't go, don't go"

1462
02:09:55,627 --> 02:09:59,294
"Don't increase the distance anymore"

1463
02:10:02,002 --> 02:10:05,627
"You have no pity"

1464
02:10:07,544 --> 02:10:11,919
"At least throw a look of love my way"

1465
02:10:31,585 --> 02:10:37,043
"I will stop this spinning earth
I will tie up time itself"

1466
02:10:37,044 --> 02:10:40,543
"Love inside you
I will create it"

1467
02:10:40,544 --> 02:10:45,751
'Do you know how crazy I am about you?
I will bring the proof and show you"

1468
02:10:45,752 --> 02:10:49,376
"My entire life is filled
With your signatures"

1469
02:10:49,377 --> 02:10:52,044
"You made words speak in the silence"

1470
02:10:52,294 --> 02:10:53,668
"Those sweet nothings, to you"

1471
02:10:53,669 --> 02:10:56,668
'When asked to listen,
you throw them away saying you won't"

1472
02:10:56,669 --> 02:11:00,877
"What should I do to make you love me?"

1473
02:11:00,960 --> 02:11:05,044
"What should I give for you to walk alongside me?"

1474
02:11:05,252 --> 02:11:07,335
"Searching every atom, inside you"

1475
02:11:07,585 --> 02:11:09,627
"I am there in some corner"

1476
02:11:09,835 --> 02:11:11,877
"More than me, in this world"

1477
02:11:12,085 --> 02:11:14,002
"There is no lover, girl"

1478
02:11:50,377 --> 02:11:53,085
"What do you know of my pain?"

1479
02:11:54,502 --> 02:11:56,919
"Will you understand it even if I tell you?"

1480
02:11:59,133 --> 02:12:01,092
"Can you tell just by looking with your eyes"

1481
02:12:01,252 --> 02:12:03,376
"How many of your thorns are pierced in me?"

1482
02:12:03,377 --> 02:12:05,668
"Is there a language to express my agony."

1483
02:12:05,669 --> 02:12:07,709
"No matter how many scripts exist on earth?"

1484
02:12:07,710 --> 02:12:12,251
"If you pay back my debt of love"

1485
02:12:12,252 --> 02:12:16,293
"I will go away without ever being seen again"

1486
02:12:16,294 --> 02:12:21,084
"If you try to calculate my interest"

1487
02:12:21,085 --> 02:12:25,334
"Even the numbers will start sweating"

1488
02:12:25,335 --> 02:12:29,918
"From deep within the paths of war
Bringing my heart"

1489
02:12:29,919 --> 02:12:32,459
"You showed yourself to me like a mirror"

1490
02:12:32,460 --> 02:12:36,793
"What should I do to make you love me?"

1491
02:12:36,794 --> 02:12:38,543
"What should I give"

1492
02:12:38,544 --> 02:12:41,209
"For you to walk alongside me?"

1493
02:12:41,210 --> 02:12:43,668
"Searching every atom, inside you"

1494
02:12:43,669 --> 02:12:45,709
"I am there in some corner"

1495
02:12:45,710 --> 02:12:50,752
"No one in this world
Loves you more than I do, girl... O..."

1496
02:13:37,335 --> 02:13:39,377
"If it erases simply because you wipe it away"

1497
02:13:41,169 --> 02:13:43,960
"How can it be called love?"

1498
02:13:45,919 --> 02:13:48,251
"The body will eventually turn to dust"

1499
02:13:48,252 --> 02:13:50,418
"No matter what you do to stop it"

1500
02:13:50,419 --> 02:13:52,544
"How will the memory die?"

1501
02:13:52,669 --> 02:13:54,668
"Even if it is killed and buried"

1502
02:13:54,669 --> 02:13:58,627
"The soul leaves the body"

1503
02:13:59,127 --> 02:14:03,044
"But the body cannot depart
leaving the soul behind"

1504
02:14:03,919 --> 02:14:11,835
"Alivelu Manga will never leave this Srinivasa
And go away"

1505
02:14:12,210 --> 02:14:15,001
"There is a certain belief in me"

1506
02:14:15,002 --> 02:14:17,501
"That at some moment you will become mine"

1507
02:14:17,502 --> 02:14:19,335
Why don't you tell her the truth?

1508
02:14:19,460 --> 02:14:23,460
"What should I do to make you love me?"

1509
02:14:23,877 --> 02:14:28,043
"What war should I wage for you
to walk alongside me?"

1510
02:14:28,044 --> 02:14:30,084
"Searching every atom, inside you"

1511
02:14:30,085 --> 02:14:32,501
"I am there in some corner"

1512
02:14:32,502 --> 02:14:38,127
"No one in this world
Loves you more than I do, girl... O..."

1513
02:14:54,919 --> 02:14:55,794
Vasu Babu!

1514
02:14:57,919 --> 02:14:59,210
Time is running out, Swatantra Babu.

1515
02:15:00,710 --> 02:15:03,335
Manga is not giving me even
a little space in her mind.

1516
02:15:04,960 --> 02:15:06,585
How can I come first in her life?

1517
02:15:10,585 --> 02:15:11,335
Alright, everyone, let's move!

1518
02:15:12,335 --> 02:15:12,877
Subbareddy...

1519
02:15:12,960 --> 02:15:13,460
Brother!

1520
02:15:13,585 --> 02:15:14,627
Tell them to start the vehicles.

1521
02:15:15,377 --> 02:15:16,794
Hey, where is Manga?

1522
02:15:18,502 --> 02:15:19,002
Vara!

1523
02:15:19,979 --> 02:15:21,729
Just ten minutes, she is getting ready!

1524
02:15:21,877 --> 02:15:22,877
We are running out of time,

1525
02:15:22,960 --> 02:15:24,460
I'll bring her. You all go ahead.

1526
02:15:24,558 --> 02:15:26,183
We'll be at the temple.
Come quickly.

1527
02:15:26,208 --> 02:15:27,208
Yeah, I'll bring her.

1528
02:15:28,044 --> 02:15:28,627
Get in.

1529
02:15:50,752 --> 02:15:51,669
Babu...

1530
02:15:53,627 --> 02:15:55,252
Manga is calling you.

1531
02:16:34,877 --> 02:16:36,044
It's nothing, Sreenu...

1532
02:16:37,204 --> 02:16:39,163
I just wanted to ask if you could
put this luggage in the car.

1533
02:16:53,127 --> 02:16:53,627
Hello,

1534
02:16:53,919 --> 02:16:54,502
Tell me.

1535
02:16:57,044 --> 02:16:57,544
Hey!

1536
02:16:57,835 --> 02:16:58,710
What are you talking about?!

1537
02:16:59,252 --> 02:17:00,459
Hey, turn the car around! Turn it back!

1538
02:17:00,460 --> 02:17:00,877
Turn it around

1539
02:17:01,044 --> 02:17:01,627
Turn it around, quickly!

1540
02:17:21,002 --> 02:17:24,252
Brother... please, brother...
just listen to me once.

1541
02:17:24,377 --> 02:17:24,835
Hey!

1542
02:17:25,460 --> 02:17:27,044
What is there for me to listen to?

1543
02:17:27,585 --> 02:17:30,044
I pampered her like a princess and put
her on a pedestal because she was my daughter.

1544
02:17:30,460 --> 02:17:32,585
In Ballary, she fell in love with
someone and went to the brink of death for him.

1545
02:17:32,752 --> 02:17:33,294
And now?

1546
02:17:33,794 --> 02:17:35,919
She has run away with a common house servant!

1547
02:17:45,210 --> 02:17:45,919
Tell me

1548
02:17:46,377 --> 02:17:49,169
Brother, Vasu Babu is going via the Kanipakam route.

1549
02:17:49,752 --> 02:17:52,169
Your daughter didn't love
two different men, as you think!

1550
02:17:53,169 --> 02:17:55,877
This Sreenu is the very same
Vasu Babu she loved back in Ballary!

1551
02:17:58,794 --> 02:18:00,210
What are you saying?

1552
02:18:01,169 --> 02:18:02,669
Did you know about this all along?

1553
02:18:03,377 --> 02:18:04,252
Yes.

1554
02:18:06,377 --> 02:18:09,044
You mean... you hid all of this from me?

1555
02:18:10,294 --> 02:18:11,169
Yes!

1556
02:18:11,877 --> 02:18:15,835
If he wanted to, he could have reminded her of
everything and taken Manga away on the very first day.

1557
02:18:16,377 --> 02:18:17,794
But he chose not to.

1558
02:18:20,085 --> 02:18:23,835
He said that forcing past memories might bring a
person physically close, but it will never win back their heart.

1559
02:18:24,252 --> 02:18:26,377
He yearned so deeply for
your daughter's true love.

1560
02:18:27,752 --> 02:18:30,710
He made Manga
fall in love with him all over again.

1561
02:19:07,252 --> 02:19:08,294
I love you, Sreenu...

1562
02:19:12,960 --> 02:19:13,710
I love you...

1563
02:19:17,335 --> 02:19:19,377
You separated them once...

1564
02:19:19,919 --> 02:19:21,919
We're standing
before the Lord Himself.

1565
02:19:22,335 --> 02:19:25,710
it is Lord Venkateswara
himself who has reunited them now.

1566
02:19:31,085 --> 02:19:34,210
You once told me that if love truly exists in here...

1567
02:19:34,669 --> 02:19:36,960
your heart beats faster whenever that person is near.

1568
02:19:37,502 --> 02:19:39,044
The very first time I saw you...

1569
02:19:39,544 --> 02:19:41,169
that is exactly what happened to me, Sreenu.

1570
02:19:50,419 --> 02:19:53,127
Back then, my heart didn't understand why.

1571
02:19:53,877 --> 02:19:55,584
You also said that if there is a deep madness in here...

1572
02:19:55,585 --> 02:19:58,835
you will feel completely restless
and lost when that person is away.

1573
02:19:59,710 --> 02:20:03,127
When I can't see you, I feel the same way.

1574
02:20:11,294 --> 02:20:16,419
You told me that when someone is your very life,
then being separated from them feels like death itself.

1575
02:20:17,877 --> 02:20:21,335
I have experienced that exact pain, Sreenu.

1576
02:20:28,419 --> 02:20:29,127
See?

1577
02:20:29,335 --> 02:20:30,919
I was so nervous,

1578
02:20:31,002 --> 02:20:34,127
now that I've confessed my love to you,
I'm not even stuttering anymore.

1579
02:20:35,585 --> 02:20:40,710
It is clear that this Sreenu is
the only one meant to stand by Manga.

1580
02:20:43,669 --> 02:20:48,919
It was only after meeting you that
I realized a man could love this deeply.

1581
02:20:56,294 --> 02:20:58,252
You have taken the first place in my heart, Sreenu.

1582
02:20:59,727 --> 02:21:00,852
I love you, Sreenu.

1583
02:21:00,960 --> 02:21:01,794
I love you.

1584
02:21:07,710 --> 02:21:09,794
My Tirupati vow has been fulfilled, Manga.

1585
02:21:11,627 --> 02:21:14,002
God has blessed me with the love I longed for.

1586
02:21:15,377 --> 02:21:17,127
No one in this lifetime can ever separate us again.

1587
02:21:19,877 --> 02:21:20,544
Hey!

1588
02:21:21,585 --> 02:21:23,585
What about my name and reputation in this town?!

1589
02:21:24,502 --> 02:21:27,002
All you ever care about is your reputation and status!

1590
02:21:27,488 --> 02:21:29,613
Do you have any idea about
the kind of legacy and power they hold?

1591
02:21:30,052 --> 02:21:31,760
Who do you think Sreenu actually is?

1592
02:21:31,920 --> 02:21:33,295
He is the grandson of Venkatappayya Naidu!

1593
02:21:33,502 --> 02:21:35,502
If you want to know who Venkatappa Naidu is

1594
02:21:35,585 --> 02:21:37,960
go and ask anyone in Ballary district...
they will tell you!

1595
02:21:38,856 --> 02:21:41,106
If they decided to take Manga away,

1596
02:21:41,284 --> 02:21:43,700
all your power and army of men
wouldn't be enough to stand in their way!

1597
02:21:44,598 --> 02:21:45,598
And yet...

1598
02:21:46,307 --> 02:21:49,724
Sreenu chose to live as a servant
in your own house...

1599
02:21:50,391 --> 02:21:51,932
all for your daughter's love.

1600
02:22:19,891 --> 02:22:21,932
My name is Venkatappayya Naidu.

1601
02:22:24,432 --> 02:22:26,974
The Vasu Babu who loved your daughter...

1602
02:22:28,141 --> 02:22:29,349
is my grandson.

1603
02:22:31,391 --> 02:22:33,807
He lost both his parents when he was just a child.

1604
02:22:34,516 --> 02:22:36,599
Since then, I have been his everything...

1605
02:22:37,474 --> 02:22:38,974
and he is the only one I have in this world.

1606
02:22:41,766 --> 02:22:44,557
This isn't the world he was raised in...

1607
02:22:46,099 --> 02:22:49,016
If someone raised a knife,
I taught him to answer with blood

1608
02:22:50,932 --> 02:22:53,849
If someone crossed the line,
I taught him to make them tremble.

1609
02:22:54,641 --> 02:22:57,057
That's what I taught him.

1610
02:23:02,724 --> 02:23:05,057
When he was little, he'd ask,
'Grandpa, where's my mother?

1611
02:23:06,391 --> 02:23:08,141
But we cannot bring back those
who have passed, can we?

1612
02:23:09,682 --> 02:23:11,016
Now, after all these years...

1613
02:23:11,766 --> 02:23:13,432
He has asked me for Manga.

1614
02:23:25,474 --> 02:23:28,349
We once made the mistake of separating them.

1615
02:23:29,682 --> 02:23:32,349
That mistake must never
happen again, Peddireddy.

1616
02:23:34,557 --> 02:23:37,432
I have not come here to wage
a war against you, Peddireddy.

1617
02:23:38,557 --> 02:23:39,891
If I had come for that...

1618
02:23:41,182 --> 02:23:42,432
Things would have turned out very differently.

1619
02:23:45,183 --> 02:23:47,267
I have come to ask for your daughter's hand.

1620
02:23:48,766 --> 02:23:50,766
Don't think twice just because there
are no women in our family.

1621
02:23:52,266 --> 02:23:54,057
Send your daughter to my home.

1622
02:23:57,391 --> 02:23:59,057
I will cherish her like a goddess.

1623
02:25:37,932 --> 02:25:38,557
Hey!

1624
02:25:39,849 --> 02:25:41,599
Take these two to Ballari...

1625
02:25:41,724 --> 02:25:44,391
and bury them up to their necks near our factory.

1626
02:25:45,182 --> 02:25:45,932
I'll be there later.

1627
02:25:46,599 --> 02:25:47,766
Hey, Sreenu!

1628
02:25:53,891 --> 02:25:55,682
Before I get you two married,

1629
02:25:56,349 --> 02:25:57,474
you must promise me one thing.

1630
02:25:57,974 --> 02:25:58,557
What is it?

1631
02:25:58,974 --> 02:26:04,599
My daughter must never know
there was someone named Vasu Babu in her life.

1632
02:26:05,016 --> 02:26:05,891
Because...

1633
02:26:06,307 --> 02:26:10,932
I don't want her to ever know
that I was the villain in her love story.

1634
02:26:12,807 --> 02:26:17,307
Let her remember me only as a good father.

1635
02:26:18,383 --> 02:26:19,008
Okay.

1636
02:26:26,099 --> 02:26:27,057
Keep it with you.

1637
02:26:35,266 --> 02:26:36,057
Sreenu!

